ID   1.1.1.95
DE   Phosphoglycerate dehydrogenase.
AN   3-phosphoglycerate dehydrogenase.
AN   3-phosphoglyceric acid dehydrogenase.
AN   3PHP reductase.
AN   Alpha-KG reductase.
AN   Alpha-phosphoglycerate dehydrogenase.
AN   D-3-phosphoglycerate dehydrogenase.
AN   Glycerate 3-phosphate dehydrogenase.
AN   Glycerate-1,3-phosphate dehydrogenase.
AN   PGDH.
AN   Phosphoglycerate oxidoreductase.
AN   Phosphoglyceric acid dehydrogenase.
CA   3-phospho-D-glycerate + NAD(+) = 3-phosphonooxypyruvate + NADH.
CC   -!- Catalyzes the first committed and rate-limiting step in the
CC       phosphoserine pathway of serine biosynthesis.
CC   -!- The reaction occurs predominantly in the direction of reduction.
CC   -!- The enzyme from the bacterium Escherichia coli also catalyzes the
CC       activity of EC 1.1.1.399.
