ID   1.1.1.105
DE   All-trans-retinol dehydrogenase (NAD(+)).
CA   All-trans-retinol-[cellular-retinol-binding-protein] + NAD(+) = all-
CA   trans-retinal-[cellular-retinol-binding-protein] + NADH.
CC   -!- The enzyme recognizes all-trans-retinol and all-trans-retinal as
CC       substrates and exhibits a strong preference for NAD(+)/NADH as
CC       cofactors.
CC   -!- Recognizes the substrate both in free form and when bound to
CC       cellular-retinol-binding-protein (CRBP1), but has higher affinity for
CC       the bound form.
CC   -!- No activity with 11-cis-retinol or 11-cis-retinal (cf. EC 1.1.1.315).
CC   -!- Also active with 3-alpha-hydroxysteroids.
PR   PROSITE; PDOC00060;
