ID   1.1.1.273
DE   Vellosimine dehydrogenase.
CA   10-deoxysarpagine + NADP(+) = vellosimine + NADPH.
CC   -!- Also acts on related alkaloids with an endo-aldehyde group such as
CC       vellosimine (same stereochemistry at C-16) but only slight activity
CC       with exo-aldehydes (epimeric at C-16).
CC   -!- Detected in many cell suspension cultures of plants from the family
CC       Apocynaceae.
