ID   1.1.5.7
DE   Cyclic alcohol dehydrogenase (quinone).
AN   Cyclic alcohol dehydrogenase.
AN   MCAD.
CA   A cyclic alcohol + a quinone = a cyclic ketone + a quinol.
CC   -!- This enzyme oxidizes a wide variety of cyclic alcohols.
CC   -!- Some minor enzyme activity is found with aliphatic secondary alcohols
CC       and sugar alcohols, but not primary alcohols.
CC   -!- The enzyme is unable to catalyze the reverse reaction of cyclic
CC       ketones or aldehydes to cyclic alcohols.
CC   -!- This enzyme differs from EC 1.1.5.5, which shows activity with
CC       ethanol.
//
