ID   1.2.1.58
DE   Phenylglyoxylate dehydrogenase (acylating).
CA   Phenylglyoxylate + NAD(+) + CoA = benzoyl-S-CoA + CO(2) + NADH.
CF   FAD; Iron-sulfur; Thiamine diphosphate.
