ID   1.3.1.90
DE   tRNA-dihydrouridine(20a/20b) synthase (NAD(P)(+)).
CA   (1) 5,6-dihydrouracil(20a) in tRNA + NAD(P)(+) = uracil(20a) in tRNA +
CA   NAD(P)H.
CA   (2) 5,6-dihydrouracil(20b) in tRNA + NAD(P)(+) = uracil(20b) in tRNA +
CA   NAD(P)H.
CF   FAD.
CC   -!- The enzyme specifically modifies uracil(20a) and uracil(20b) in tRNA.
DR   O74553, DUS4_SCHPO ;  Q06063, DUS4_YEAST ;
