ID   1.3.1.91
DE   tRNA-dihydrouridine(20) synthase (NAD(P)(+)).
AN   tRNA-dihydrouridine synthase 2.
CA   5,6-dihydrouracil(20) in tRNA + NAD(P)(+) = uracil(20) in tRNA + NAD(P)H.
CF   FAD.
CC   -!- The enzyme specifically modifies uracil(20) in tRNA.
