DE   Protoporphyrinogen IX dehydrogenase (menaquinone).
CA   Protoporphyrinogen IX + 3 menaquinone = protoporphyrin IX + 3 menaquinol.
CC   -!- This enzyme enables Escherichia coli to synthesize heme in both
