ID   1.3.5.5
DE   15-cis-phytoene desaturase.
AN   PDS.
AN   Phytoene desaturase.
AN   Plant-type phytoene desaturase.
CA   15-cis-phytoene + 2 plastoquinone = 9,15,9'-tri-cis-zeta-carotene +
CA   2 plastoquinol.
CC   -!- This enzyme is involved in carotenoid biosynthesis in plants and
CC       cyanobacteria.
CC   -!- The enzyme from Synechococcus can also use NAD(+) and NADP(+) as
CC       electron acceptor under anaerobic conditions.
CC   -!- The enzyme from Gentiana lutea shows no activity with NAD(+) or
CC       NADP(+).
DR   Q07356, PDS_ARATH  ;  P80093, PDS_CAPAN  ;  P49086, PDS_MAIZE  ;
DR   Q40406, PDS_NARPS  ;  C3VEP9, PDS_ONCHC  ;  A2XDA1, PDS_ORYSI  ;
DR   Q0DUI8, PDS_ORYSJ  ;  P28554, PDS_SOLLC  ;  P28553, PDS_SOYBN  ;
DR   P26294, PDS_SYNE7  ;
//
ID   1.3.5.6
DE   9,9'-di-cis-zeta-carotene desaturase.
AN   ZDS.
AN   Zeta-carotene desaturase.
CA   9,9'-di-cis-zeta-carotene + 2 quinone = 7,9,7',9'-tetra-cis-lycopene +
CA   2 quinol.
CC   -!- This enzyme is involved in carotenoid biosynthesis in plants and
CC       cyanobacteria.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.14.99.30.
