DE   6-hydroxynicotinate reductase.
AN   6-hydroxynicotinic reductase.
AN   6-oxotetrahydro-nicotinate dehydrogenase.
AN   HNA reductase.
CA   6-oxo-1,4,5,6-tetrahydronicotinate + oxidized ferredoxin =
CA   6-hydroxynicotinate + reduced ferredoxin.
CC   -!- Forms part of the nicotinate-fermentation catabolism pathway in
CC       Eubacterium barkeri.
CC   -!- Other enzymes involved in this pathway are EC 1.17.5.1, EC 3.5.2.18,
CC       EC 1.1.1.291, EC 5.4.99.4, EC 5.3.3.6, EC 4.2.1.85 and EC 4.1.3.32.
DR   Q0QLF7, HNR_EUBBA  ;
//
ID   1.3.7.2
DE   15,16-dihydrobiliverdin:ferredoxin oxidoreductase.
CA   15,16-dihydrobiliverdin + oxidized ferredoxin = biliverdin IX-alpha +
CA   reduced ferredoxin.
CC   -!- Catalyzes the two-electron reduction of biliverdin IX-alpha at the
CC       C15 methine bridge.
CC   -!- It has been proposed that this enzyme and EC 1.3.7.3 function as a
CC       dual enzyme complex in the conversion of biliverdin IX-alpha into
CC       phycoerythrobilin.
