ID   1.4.3.19
DE   Glycine oxidase.
CA   Glycine + H(2)O + O(2) = glyoxylate + NH(3) + H(2)O(2).
CF   FAD.
CC   -!- The enzyme from Bacillus subtilis is active with glycine, sarcosine,
CC       N-ethylglycine, D-alanine, D-alpha-aminobutyrate, D-proline,
CC       D-pipecolate and N-methyl-D-alanine.
CC   -!- It differs from EC 1.4.3.3 due to its activity on sarcosine and
CC       D-pipecolate.
CC   -!- The intermediate 2-iminoacetate is used directly by EC 2.8.1.10.
