ID   1.4.4.2
DE   Glycine dehydrogenase (aminomethyl-transferring).
AN   Glycine cleavage system P-protein.
AN   Glycine decarboxylase.
AN   Glycine dehydrogenase (decarboxylating).
AN   Glycine-cleavage complex P-protein.
CA   Glycine + [glycine-cleavage complex H protein]-N(6)-lipoyl-L-lysine =
CA   [glycine-cleavage complex H protein]-S-aminomethyl-N(6)-dihydrolipoyl-L-
CA   lysine + CO(2).
CF   Pyridoxal 5'-phosphate.
CC   -!- A component of the glycine cleavage system, which is composed of four
CC       components that only loosely associate: the P protein (EC 1.4.4.2),
CC       the T protein (EC 2.1.2.10), the L protein (EC 1.8.1.4) and the
CC       lipoyl-bearing H protein.
CC   -!- Previously known as glycine synthase.
