ID   1.4.9.2
DE   Aralkylamine dehydrogenase (azurin).
AN   Aromatic amine dehydrogenase.
AN   Arylamine dehydrogenase.
CA   ArCH(2)NH(2) + H(2)O + 2 azurin = ArCHO + NH(3) + 2 reduced azurin.
CC   -!- Phenazine methosulfate can act as acceptor.
CC   -!- Acts on aromatic amines and, more slowly, on some long-chain
CC       aliphatic amines, but not on methylamine or ethylamine.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.4.99.4.
DR   P84887, AAUA_ALCFA ;  P84888, AAUB_ALCFA ;
