ID   1.5.3.14
DE   Polyamine oxidase (propane-1,3-diamine-forming).
AN   Maize PAO.
AN   MPAO.
CA   Spermidine + O(2) + H(2)O = propane-1,3-diamine + 4-aminobutanal +
CA   H(2)O(2).
CF   FAD.
CC   -!- As the products of the reaction cannot be converted directly to other
CC       polyamines, this class of polyamine oxidases is considered to be
CC       involved in the terminal catabolism of polyamines.
CC   -!- Catalyzes less efficiently the oxidation of N(1)-acetylspermine and
CC       spermine.
CC   -!- Differs in specificity from EC 1.5.3.13, EC 1.5.3.15, EC 1.5.3.16 and
CC       EC 1.5.3.17.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.5.3.11, EC 1.5.3.n6, EC 1.5.3.n7, EC 1.5.3.n8 and
CC       EC 1.5.3.n9.
DR   O64411, PAO1_MAIZE ;
//
ID   1.5.3.15
DE   N(8)-acetylspermidine oxidase (propane-1,3-diamine-forming).
CA   N(8)-acetylspermidine + O(2) + H(2)O = propane-1,3-diamine +
CA   4-acetamidobutanal + H(2)O(2).
CF   FAD.
CC   -!- Also active with N(1)-acetylspermine, weak activity with N(1),N(12)-
CC       diacetylspermine.
CC   -!- No activity with diaminopropane, putrescine, cadaverine,
CC       diaminohexane, norspermidine, spermine and spermidine.
CC   -!- Absence of monoamine oxidase (EC 1.4.3.4) activity.
CC   -!- Differs in specificity from EC 1.5.3.13, EC 1.5.3.14, EC 1.5.3.16 and
CC       EC 1.5.3.17.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.5.3.11, EC 1.5.3.n6, EC 1.5.3.n7, EC 1.5.3.n8 and
CC       EC 1.5.3.n9.
DR   O64411, PAO1_MAIZE ;
