ID   1.5.3.16
DE   Spermine oxidase.
AN   SMO.
CA   Spermine + O(2) + H(2)O = spermidine + 3-aminopropanal + H(2)O(2).
CF   FAD.
CC   -!- The enzyme from Arabidopsis thaliana (AtPAO1) oxidizes norspermine to
CC       norspermidine with high efficiency.
CC   -!- The mammalian enzyme, encoded by the SMOX gene, is a cytosolic enzyme
CC       that catalyzes the oxidation of spermine at the exo (three-carbon)
CC       side of the tertiary amine.
CC   -!- No activity with spermidine.
CC   -!- Weak activity with N(1)-acetylspermine.
CC   -!- Differs in specificity from EC 1.5.3.13, EC 1.5.3.14, EC 1.5.3.15 and
CC       EC 1.5.3.17.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.5.3.11, EC 1.5.3.n1, EC 1.5.3.n2, EC 1.5.3.n3 and
CC       EC 1.5.3.n5.
DR   Q9FNA2, PAO1_ARATH ;  Q8H191, PAO4_ARATH ;  Q9NWM0, SMOX_HUMAN ;
DR   Q99K82, SMOX_MOUSE ;
