AN   Bis-gamma-glutamylcystine reductase (NADPH).
AN   NADPH:bis-gamma-glutamylcysteine oxidoreductase.
CA   2 gamma-glutamylcysteine + NADP(+) = bis-gamma-glutamylcystine + NADPH.
CF   FAD.
CC   -!- The enzyme, which is found only in halobacteria, maintains the
