CF   Heme b; Iron-sulfur; Molybdopterin guanine dinucleotide.
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Salmonella enterica,
CC       is similar to EC 1.17.5.3.
CC   -!- The reaction occurs in vivo in the direction of thiosulfate
CC       disproportionation, which is highly endergonic.
CC   -!- It is driven by the proton motive force that occurs across the
CC       cytoplasmic membrane.
