CA   2 L-ascorbate + H(2)O(2) + 2 H(+) = L-ascorbate + L-dehydroascorbate +
CA   2 H(2)O.
CF   Heme.
CC   -!- Oxidizes ascorbate and low molecular weight aromatic substrates.
CC   -!- The monodehydroascorbate radical produced is either directly reduced
CC       back to ascorbate by EC 1.6.5.4 or undergoes non-enzymatic
CC       disproportionation to ascorbate and dehydroascorbate.
