DE   Indole 2,3-dioxygenase.
AN   Indole oxidase.
CA   Indole + O(2) = 2-formylaminobenzaldehyde.
CF   Cu cation; Flavoprotein.
CC   -!- Enzymes from the plants Tecoma stans, Jasminum grandiflorum and Zea
CC       mays are flavoproteins containing copper.
CC   -!- They are part of enzyme systems that form either anthranil (3,4-
CC       benzoisoxazole) (Tecoma stans), anthranilate (Jasminum grandiflorum)
CC       or both (Zea mays) as the final product.
CC   -!- A second enzyme from Tecoma stans is not a flavoprotein, does not
CC       require copper, and is part of a system that forms anthranilate as
CC       the final product.
//
