DE   4-hydroxymandelate synthase.
AN   4-hydroxyphenylpyruvate dioxygenase II.
CA   4-hydroxyphenylpyruvate + O(2) = (S)-4-hydroxymandelate + CO(2).
CF   Fe cation.
CC   -!- Involved in the biosynthesis of the vancomycin group of glycopeptide
CC       antibiotics.
DR   O52791, HMAS_AMYOR ;
