CA   epoxy-3-hydroxy-5,6-dihydro-12'-apo-beta-caroten-12'-al.
CA   (3) 9'-cis-neoxanthin + O(2) = 2-cis,4-trans-xanthoxin + (3S,5R,6R)-5,6-
CA   dihydroxy-6,7-didehydro-5,6-dihydro-12'-apo-beta-caroten-12'-al.
CF   Fe cation.
CC   -!- Acts on 9-cis-violaxanthin and 9'-cis-neoxanthin but not on the all-
