CA   proline-[procollagen] + succinate + CO(2).
CF   Fe(2+); L-ascorbate.
CC   -!- The enzyme, which is located within the lumen of the endoplasmic
CC       reticulum, catalyzes the 4-hydroxylation of prolines in -X-Pro-Gly-
CC       sequences.
CC   -!- The 4-hydroxyproline residues are essential for the formation of the
CC       collagen triple helix.
CC   -!- The enzyme forms a complex with protein disulfide isomerase and acts
CC       not only on procollagen but also on more than 15 other proteins that
CC       have collagen-like domains.
