CA   UMP + 2-oxoglutarate + O(2) = 5'-dehydrouridine + succinate + CO(2) +
CA   phosphate.
CF   Fe(2+).
CC   -!- The enzyme catalyzes a net dephosphorylation and oxidation of UMP to
CC       generate 5'-dehydrouridine, the first intermediate in the
CC       biosynthesis of the unusual aminoribosyl moiety found in several
CC       C(7)-furanosyl nucleosides such as A-90289s, caprazamycins,
CC       liposidomycins, muraymycins and FR-900453.
