ID   1.14.11.51
DE   DNA N(6)-methyladenine demethylase.
CA   N(6)-methyladenine in DNA + 2-oxoglutarate + O(2) = adenine in DNA +
CA   formaldehyde + succinate + CO(2).
CF   Fe(3+).
CC   -!- Catalyzes oxidative demethylation of DNA N(6)-methyladenine,
CC       a prevalent modification in LINE-1 transposons, which are
CC       specifically enriched on the human X chromosome.
