DE   Benzoyl-CoA 2,3-epoxidase.
AN   Benzoyl-CoA 2,3-dioxygenase.
AN   Benzoyl-CoA dioxygenase/reductase.
CA   Benzoyl-CoA + NADPH + O(2) = 2,3-epoxy-2,3-dihydrobenzoyl-CoA + NADP(+) +
CA   H(2)O.
CF   FAD; Fe cation; Iron-sulfur.
