CC       evansii.
CC   -!- BoxB functions as the oxygenase part of benzoyl-CoA oxygenase in
CC       conjunction with BoxA, the reductase component, which upon binding of
CC       benzoyl-CoA, transfers two electrons to the ring in the course of
CC       dioxygenation.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.14.12.21 and EC 1.14.12.n1.
