ID   1.14.13.216
DE   Asperlicin C monooxygenase.
CA   Asperlicin C + NAD(P)H + O(2) = asperlicin E + NAD(P)(+) + H(2)O.
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from the fungus Aspergillus alliaceus,
CC       contains an FAD cofactor.
CC   -!- The enzyme inserts a hydroxyl group, leading to formation of a
