CA   farnesyl)-3,4-dihydroquinoline-1-oxide + NAD(P)(+) + H(2)O.
CC   -!- The aurachin C monooxygenase from the bacterium Stigmatella
CC       aurantiaca accepts both NADH and NADPH as cofactor, but has a
CC       preference for NADH.
CC   -!- It catalyzes the initial steps in the conversion of aurachin C to
