CA   (Indol-3-yl)acetate + NADH + O(2) = 2-hydroxy-(indol-3-yl)acetate +
CA   NAD(+) + H(2)O.
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from Pseudomonas putida strains, catalyzes
