DE   Heme oxygenase (biliverdin-producing).
AN   Heme oxidase.
AN   Heme oxygenase.
AN   Heme oxygenase (decyclizing).
CA   Protoheme + 3 [reduced NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] + 3 O(2) =
CA   biliverdin + Fe(2+) + CO + 3 [oxidized NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] +
