CA   hydroxycholesterol + [oxidized NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] + H(2)O.
CF   Heme-thiolate.
CC   -!- Catalyzes the first step in the biosynthesis of bile acids.
CC   -!- The direct electron donor to the enzyme is EC 1.6.2.4.
