AN   Vitamin D(3) 25-hydroxylase.
CA   Calciol + O(2) + [reduced NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] = calcidiol +
CA   [oxidized NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] + H(2)O.
CC   -!- A microsomal enzyme isolated from human and mouse liver that
CC       bioactivates vitamin D(3).
CC   -!- While multiple isoforms (CYP27A1, CYP2J2/3, CYP3A4, CYP2D25 and
CC       CYP2C11) are able to catalyze the reaction in vitro, only CYP2R1 is
CC       thought to catalyze the reaction in humans in vivo.
CC   -!- The direct electron donor to the enzyme is EC 1.6.2.4.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.14.13.159.
