ID   1.14.14.26
DE   24-hydroxycholesterol 7-alpha-hydroxylase.
AN   24-hydroxycholesterol 7-alpha-monooxygenase.
CA   (24S)-cholest-5-ene-3-beta,24-diol + [reduced NADPH--hemoprotein
CA   reductase] + O(2) = (24S)-cholest-5-ene-3-beta,7-alpha,24-triol +
CA   [oxidized NADPH--hemoprotein reductase] + H(2)O.
CF   Heme-thiolate.
CC   -!- Found in liver microsomes and in ciliary non-pigmented epithelium.
CC   -!- Specific for (24S)-cholest-5-ene-3-beta,24-diol, which is formed
CC       mostly in the brain by EC 1.14.14.25.
CC   -!- The direct electron donor to the enzyme is EC 1.6.2.4.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.14.13.99.
