CA   (E)-4-hydroxyphenylacetaldehyde oxime + [reduced NADPH--hemoprotein
CA   reductase] + O(2) = (S)-4-hydroxymandelonitrile + [oxidized NADPH-
CA   -hemoprotein reductase] + 2 H(2)O.
CF   Heme-thiolate.
CC   -!- Involved in the biosynthesis of the cyanogenic glucoside dhurrin in
CC       sorghum.
CC   -!- It catalyzes three different activities - isomerization of the (E)
