CC   -!- The enzyme also catalyzes the hydroxylation of
CC       3,5,7,3',4'-pentahydroxyflavanone (taxifolin) at the 5' position,
CC       forming ampelopsin.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.14.13.88.
