ID   1.14.19.40
DE   Hex-5-enoyl-[acyl-carrier protein] acetylenase.
CA   Hex-5-enoyl-[acyl-carrier protein] + 2 reduced ferredoxin [iron-sulfur]
CA   cluster + O(2) + 2 H(+) = hex-5-ynoyl-[acyl-carrier protein] + 2 oxidized
CA   ferredoxin [iron-sulfur] cluster + 2 H(2)O.
