//
ID   1.14.19.42
DE   Palmitoyl-[glycerolipid] 7-desaturase.
CA   A 1-acyl-2-palmitoyl-[glycerolipid] + 2 reduced ferredoxin [iron-sulfur]
CA   cluster + O(2) + 2 H(+) = a 1-acyl-2-((7Z)-hexadec-7-enoyl)-
CA   [glycerolipid] + 2 oxidized ferredoxin [iron-sulfur] cluster + 2 H(2)O.
CC   -!- The enzyme introduces a cis double bond at carbon 7 of a palmitoyl
CC       group attached to the sn-2 position of glycerolipids.
CC   -!- The enzyme from the plant Arabidopsis thaliana is specific for
