DE   (5R)-carbapenem-3-carboxylate synthase.
CA   (3S,5S)-carbapenam-3-carboxylate + 2-oxoglutarate + O(2) = (5R)-carbapen-
CA   2-em-3-carboxylate + succinate + CO(2) + H(2)O.
CF   Fe(2+).
CC   -!- The enzyme is involved in the biosynthesis of the carbapenem beta-
CC       lactam antibiotic (5R)-carbapen-2-em-3-carboxylate in the bacterium
CC       Pectobacterium carotovorum.
CC   -!- It catalyzes a stereoinversion at C(5) and introduces a double bond
