ID   1.16.1.8
DE   [Methionine synthase] reductase.
AN   [Methionine synthase]-cobalamin methyltransferase (cob(II)alamin
AN   reducing).
AN   Methionine synthase cob(II)alamin reductase (methylating).
AN   Methionine synthase reductase.
CA   2 [methionine synthase]-methylcob(III)alamin + 2 S-adenosylhomocysteine +
CA   NADP(+) = 2 [methionine synthase]-cob(II)alamin + NADPH + 2 S-adenosyl-L-
CA   methionine.
CF   FAD; FMN.
CC   -!- The substrate of the enzyme is the inactivated cobalt(II) form of
CC       EC 2.1.1.13.
CC   -!- Electrons are transferred from NADPH to FAD to FMN.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 2.1.1.135.
DR   Q4JIJ2, MTRR_BOVIN ;  Q17574, MTRR_CAEEL ;  Q9UBK8, MTRR_HUMAN ;
