ID   1.17.1.8
DE   4-hydroxy-tetrahydrodipicolinate reductase.
AN   Dihydrodipicolinate reductase.
CA   (S)-2,3,4,5-tetrahydropyridine-2,6-dicarboxylate + NAD(P)(+) + H(2)O =
CA   (2S,4S)-4-hydroxy-2,3,4,5-tetrahydrodipicolinate + NAD(P)H.
CC   -!- Studies of the enzyme from the bacterium Escherichia coli have shown
CC       that the enzyme accepts (2S,4S)-4-hydroxy-2,3,4,5-
CC       tetrahydrodipicolinate and not (S)-2,3-dihydrodipicolinate as
CC       originally thought.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.3.1.26.
