ID   2.1.1.38
DE   O-demethylpuromycin O-methyltransferase.
CA   S-adenosyl-L-methionine + O-demethylpuromycin = S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine
CA   + puromycin.
CC   -!- Puromycin is the antibiotic derived from N(6)-dimethyladenosine by
CC       replacing the 3'-hydroxy group with an amino group and acylating this
CC       with 4-O-methyltyrosine.
