ID   2.1.1.72
DE   Site-specific DNA-methyltransferase (adenine-specific).
AN   Modification methylase.
AN   N-6 adenine-specific DNA methylase.
AN   Restriction-modification system.
CA   S-adenosyl-L-methionine + adenine in DNA = S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine +
CA   N-6-methyladenine in DNA.
CC   -!- This is a large group of enzymes, most of which form so-called
CC       'restriction-modification systems', with nucleases that possess
