//
ID   2.1.1.167
DE   27S pre-rRNA (guanosine(2922)-2'-O)-methyltransferase.
CA   S-adenosyl-L-methionine + guanosine(2922) in 27S pre-rRNA = S-adenosyl-L-
CA   homocysteine + 2'-O-methylguanosine(2922) in 27S pre-rRNA.
CC   -!- Spb1p is a site-specific 2'-O-ribose RNA methyltransferase that
CC       catalyzes the formation of 2'-O-methylguanosine(2922), a universally
CC       conserved position of the catalytic center of the ribosome that is
CC       essential for translation.
CC   -!- 2'-O-methylguanosine(2922) is formed at a later stage of the
CC       processing, during the maturation of of the 27S pre-rRNA.
CC   -!- In absence of snR52, Spb1p can also catalyze the formation of
CC       uridine(2921).
DR   P25582, SPB1_YEAST ;
//
ID   2.1.1.168
DE   21S rRNA (uridine(2791)-2'-O)-methyltransferase.
AN   Mitochondrial rRNA MTase 2.
CA   S-adenosyl-L-methionine + uridine(2791) in 21S rRNA = S-adenosyl-L-
CA   homocysteine + 2'-O-methyluridine(2791) in 21S rRNA.
CC   -!- The enzyme catalyzes the methylation of uridine(2791) of
CC       mitochondrial 21S rRNA.
DR   P53123, MRM2_YEAST ;
//
ID   2.1.1.169
DE   Tricetin 3',4',5'-O-trimethyltransferase.
CA   3 S-adenosyl-L-methionine + tricetin = 3 S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine +
CA   3',4',5'-O-trimethyltricetin.
CC   -!- The enzyme from Triticum aestivum catalyzes the sequential
CC       O-methylation of tricetin via 3'-O-methyltricetin, 3',5'-O-
CC       methyltricetin to 3',4',5'-O-trimethyltricetin (2).
DR   Q38J50, FOMT2_WHEAT;
//
ID   2.1.1.170
DE   16S rRNA (guanine(527)-N(7))-methyltransferase.
CA   S-adenosyl-L-methionine + guanine(527) in 16S rRNA = S-adenosyl-L-
CA   homocysteine + N(7)-methylguanine(527) in 16S rRNA.
CC   -!- The enzyme specifically methylates guanine(527) at N(7) in 16S rRNA.
