DE   Cobalt-precorrin-6B (C(15))-methyltransferase (decarboxylating).
AN   Cobalt-precorrin-6Y (C(15))-methyltransferase (decarboxylating).
CA   Cobalt-precorrin-6B + S-adenosyl-L-methionine = cobalt-precorrin-7 +
CA   S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine + CO(2).
CC   -!- This enzyme catalyzes both methylation at C-15 and decarboxylation of
CC       the C-12 acetate side chain of cobalt-precorrin-6B, a step in the
CC       anaerobic (early cobalt insertion) adenosylcobalamin biosynthesis
CC       pathway.
