DE   16S rRNA (cytidine(1402)-2'-O)-methyltransferase.
CA   S-adenosyl-L-methionine + cytidine(1402) in 16S rRNA = S-adenosyl-L-
CA   homocysteine + 2'-O-methylcytidine(1402) in 16S rRNA.
