ID   2.1.1.208
DE   23S rRNA (uridine(2479)-2'-O)-methyltransferase.
CA   S-adenosyl-L-methionine + uridine(2479) in 23S rRNA = S-adenosyl-L-
CA   homocysteine + 2'-O-methyluridine(2479) in 23S rRNA.
CC   -!- Streptomyces viridochromogenes produces the antibiotic avilamycin A
CC       which binds to the 50S ribosomal subunit to inhibit protein
CC       synthesis.
CC   -!- To protect itself from the antibiotic, Streptomyces viridochromogenes
CC       utilizes two methyltransferases, 23S rRNA (uridine(2479)-2'-O)-
CC       methyltransferase and EC 2.1.1.209 whose actions confer avilamycin
CC       resistance to the RNA.
DR   Q9F5K6, AVRB_STRVR ;
//
ID   2.1.1.209
DE   23S rRNA (guanine(2535)-N(1))-methyltransferase.
CA   S-adenosyl-L-methionine + guanine(2535) in 23S rRNA = S-adenosyl-L-
CA   homocysteine + N(1)-methylguanine(2535) in 23S rRNA.
CC   -!- Streptomyces viridochromogenes produces the antibiotic avilamycin A
CC       which binds to the 50S ribosomal subunit to inhibit protein
CC       synthesis.
CC   -!- To protect itself from the antibiotic, Streptomyces viridochromogenes
CC       utilizes two methyltransferases, 23S rRNA (guanine(2535)-N(1))-
CC       methyltransferase and EC 2.1.1.208 whose actions confer avilamycin
CC       resistance to the RNA.
DR   Q9F5K5, AVRA_STRVR ;
