DE   Demethylspheroidene O-methyltransferase.
AN   1-HO-carotenoid methylase.
AN   1-hydroxycarotenoid methylase.
AN   1-hydroxycarotenoid O-methylase.
CA   S-adenosyl-L-methionine + demethylspheroidene = S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine
CA   + spheroidene.
CC   -!- In Rhodopseudomonas capsulata and Rubrivivax gelatinosus the enzyme
CC       is involved in biosynthesis of spheroidene.
CC   -!- In Rubrivivax gelatinosus the enzyme also catalyzes the methylation
CC       of demethylspirilloxanthin to spirilloxanthin and the methylation of
CC       3,4-didehydrorhodopin to anhydrorhodovibrin.
