DE   2,7,4'-trihydroxyisoflavanone 4'-O-methyltransferase.
CA   S-adenosyl-L-methionine + 2,4',7-trihydroxyisoflavanone = S-adenosyl-L-
CA   homocysteine + 2,7-dihydroxy-4'-methoxyisoflavanone.
CC   -!- Specifically methylates 2,4',7-trihydroxyisoflavanone on the
CC       4'-position.
CC   -!- No activity with isoflavones.
CC   -!- The enzyme is involved in formononetin biosynthesis in legumes.
CC   -!- The protein from pea (Pisum sativum) also methylates (+)-
CC       6a-hydroxymaackiain at the 3-position (cf. EC 2.1.1.270).
