DE   2-polyprenyl-6-hydroxyphenol methylase.
AN   2-octaprenyl-6-hydroxyphenol methylase.
CA   S-adenosyl-L-methionine + 3-(all-trans-polyprenyl)benzene-1,2-diol =
CA   S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine + 2-methoxy-6-(all-trans-polyprenyl)phenol.
CC   -!- UbiG catalyzes both methylation steps in ubiquinone biosynthesis in
CC       Escherichia coli.
CC   -!- The second methylation is classified as EC 2.1.1.64.
