CC       the first methylation by Coq3 occurs at a different position within
CC       the pathway, and thus involves a different substrate and is
CC       classified as EC 2.1.1.114.
CC   -!- The substrate of the eukaryotic enzyme (3,4-dihydroxy-5-all-trans-
CC       polyprenylbenzoate) differs by an additional carboxylate moiety.
