DE   2-ketoarginine methyltransferase.
CA   S-adenosyl-L-methionine + 5-guanidino-2-oxopentanoate = S-adenosyl-L-
CA   homocysteine + 5-guanidino-3-methyl-2-oxopentanoate.
CC   -!- The enzyme is involved in production of the rare amino acid
