ID   2.1.1.319
DE   Type I protein arginine methyltransferase.
CA   2 S-adenosyl-L-methionine + [protein]-L-arginine = 2 S-adenosyl-L-
CA   homocysteine + [protein]-N(omega),N(omega)-dimethyl-L-arginine.
