CC       others (e.g. PRMT4 and PRMT6) are rather specific.
CC   -!- The enzyme has a preference for methylating arginine residues that
CC       are flanked by one or more glycine residues.
CC   -!- PRMT1 is responsible for the bulk (about 85%) of total protein
CC       arginine methylation activity in mammalian cells.
CC   -!- Cf. EC 2.1.1.320, EC 2.1.1.321 and EC 2.1.1.322.
