CC       flimentous bacteria (Chloroflexaceae), is a radical S-adenosyl-L-
CC       methionine (AdoMet) enzyme and contains a [4Fe-4S] cluster.
CC   -!- It adds a methyl group at the C-12(1) position of
CC       bacteriochlorophylls of the c, d and e types.
