//
ID   2.1.2.10
DE   Aminomethyltransferase.
AN   Glycine synthase.
AN   Glycine-cleavage system T-protein.
AN   Tetrahydrofolate aminomethyltransferase.
CA   [Protein]-S(8)-aminomethyldihydrolipoyllysine + tetrahydrofolate =
CA   [protein]-dihydrolipoyllysine + 5,10-methylenetetrahydrofolate + NH(3).
CC   -!- A component, with EC 1.4.4.2 and EC 1.8.1.4, of the glycine cleavage
CC       system, formerly known as glycine synthase.
CC   -!- The glycine cleavage system is composed of four components that only
CC       loosely associate: the P protein (EC 1.4.4.2), the T protein
CC       (EC 2.1.2.10), the L protein (EC 1.8.1.4) and the lipoyl-bearing H
CC       protein.
