ID   2.2.1.7
DE   1-deoxy-D-xylulose-5-phosphate synthase.
AN   1-deoxy-D-xylulose-5-phosphate pyruvate-lyase (carboxylating).
AN   1-deoxyxylulose-5-phosphate synthase.
AN   DXP-synthase.
