ID   2.2.1.8
DE   Fluorothreonine transaldolase.
CA   L-threonine + fluoroacetaldehyde = acetaldehyde + 4-fluoro-L-threonine.
CF   Pyridoxal 5'-phosphate.
CC   -!- Can also convert chloroacetaldehyde into 4-chloro-L-threonine.
