ID   2.3.1.183
DE   Phosphinothricin acetyltransferase.
AN   PPT acetyltransferase.
AN   PPT N-acetyltransferase.
CA   Acetyl-CoA + phosphinothricin = CoA + N-acetylphosphinothricin.
CC   -!- The substrate phosphinothricin is used as a nonselective herbicide
CC       and is a potent inhibitor of EC 6.3.1.2, a key enzyme of nitrogen
CC       metabolism in plants.
PR   PROSITE; PDOC51186;
DR   P31668, PAT_ALCFA  ;  P21861, PAT_STRCO  ;  P16426, PAT_STRHY  ;
DR   Q57146, PAT_STRVT  ;  P71043, YWNH_BACSU ;
