ID   2.3.1.220
DE   2,4,6-trihydroxybenzophenone synthase.
AN   Benzophenone synthase.
CA   3 malonyl-CoA + benzoyl-CoA = 4 CoA + 2,4,6-trihydroxybenzophenone +
CA   3 CO(2).
CC   -!- Involved in the biosynthesis of plant xanthones.
CC   -!- The enzyme from the plant Hypericum androsaemum L can use
CC       3-hydroxybenzoyl-CoA instead of benzoyl-CoA, but with lower activity
CC       (cf. EC 2.3.1.151).
DR   L7NCQ3, TBSYN_GARMA;  Q8SAS8, TBSYN_HYPAN;
//
ID   2.3.1.221
DE   Noranthrone synthase.
AN   Norsolorinic acid anthrone synthase.
AN   Polyketide synthase A.
CA   7 malonyl-CoA + hexanoyl-[acyl-carrier protein] = 7 CoA + norsolorinate
CA   anthrone + [acyl-carrier protein] + 7 CO(2) + 2 H(2)O.
CC   -!- A multi-domain polyketide synthase involved in the synthesis of
CC       aflatoxins in the fungus Aspergillus parasiticus.
CC   -!- The hexanoyl starter unit is provided to the acyl-carrier protein
CC       (ACP) domain by a dedicated fungal fatty acid synthase.
DR   Q12053, AFLC_ASPPU ;  Q30DW5, PKSA_DOTSE ;  M2XHZ5, PKSA_DOTSN ;
//
ID   2.3.1.222
DE   Phosphate propanoyltransferase.
