ID   2.3.1.243
DE   Lauroyl-Kdo(2)-lipid IV(A) myristoyltransferase.
AN   Myristoyl-[acyl-carrier protein]:alpha-Kdo-(2->4)-alpha-Kdo-(2->6)-
AN   (dodecanoyl)-lipid IV(A) O-myristoyltransferase.
CA   A tetradecanoyl-[acyl-carrier protein] + (Kdo)(2)-(dodecanoyl)-lipid
CA   IV(A) = Kdo(2)-lipid A + a holo-[acyl-carrier protein].
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Escherichia coli,
CC       is involed in the biosynthesis of the phosphorylated outer membrane
CC       glycolipid lipid A.
