ID   2.3.1.250
DE   [Wnt protein] O-palmitoleoyl transferase.
AN   Porcupine.
CA   (9Z)-hexadec-9-enoyl-CoA + [Wnt]-L-serine = CoA + [Wnt]-O-(9Z)-hexadec-9-
CA   enoyl-L-serine.
CC   -!- The enzyme, found in animals, modifies a specific serine residue in
CC       Wnt proteins, e.g. Ser(209) in human Wnt3a and Ser(224) in chicken
CC       WNT1.
CC   -!- The enzyme can accept C(13) to C(16) fatty acids in vitro, but only
CC       (9Z)-hexadecenoate modification is observed in vivo.
CC   -!- cf. EC 3.1.1.98.
