ID   2.3.1.251
DE   Lipid IV(A) palmitoyltransferase.
CA   (1) 1-palmitoyl-2-acyl-sn-glycero-3-phosphocholine + hexa-acyl lipid A =
CA   2-acyl-sn-glycero-3-phosphocholine + hepta-acyl lipid A.
CA   (2) 1-palmitoyl-2-acyl-sn-glycero-3-phosphocholine + lipid II(A) =
CA   2-acyl-sn-glycero-3-phosphocholine + lipid II(B).
CA   (3) 1-palmitoyl-2-acyl-sn-glycero-3-phosphocholine + lipid IV(A) =
CA   2-acyl-sn-glycero-3-phosphocholine + lipid IV(B).
CC   -!- Isolated from the bacteria Escherichia coli and Salmonella
CC       typhimurium.
CC   -!- The enzyme prefers phosphatidylcholine with a palmitoyl group at the
