DE   N-terminal amino-acid N(alpha)-acetyltransferase NatA.
CA   (1) Acetyl-CoA + an N-terminal-glycyl-[protein] = an N-terminal-N(alpha)-
CA   acetyl-glycyl-[protein] + CoA.
