CA   (3) Acetyl-CoA + an N-terminal-L-seryl-[protein] = an N-terminal-
CA   N(alpha)-acetyl-L-seryl-[protein] + CoA.
CA   (4) Acetyl-CoA + an N-terminal-L-valyl-[protein] = an N-terminal-
