DE   N-terminal methionine N(alpha)-acetyltransferase NatE.
CA   (1) Acetyl-CoA + an N-terminal-L-methionyl-L-alanyl-[protein] =
CA   an N-terminal-N(alpha)-acetyl-L-methionyl-L-alanyl-[protein] + CoA.
