CA   an N-terminal-N(alpha)-acetyl-L-methionyl-L-lysyl-[protein] + CoA.
CA   (6) Acetyl-CoA + an N-terminal-L-methionyl-L-leucyl-[protein] =
CA   an N-terminal-N(alpha)-acetyl-L-methionyl-L-leucyl-[protein] + CoA.
CA   (7) Acetyl-CoA + an N-terminal-L-methionyl-L-phenylalanyl-[protein] =
CA   an N-terminal-N(alpha)-acetyl-L-methionyl-L-phenylalanyl-[protein] + CoA.
