ID   2.3.1.n3
DE   Glycerol-3-phosphate acyltransferase (acyl-phosphate transferring).
AN   Acyl-phosphate--glycerol-3-phosphate acyltransferase.
AN   Acyl-PO(4) G3P acyltransferase.
AN   G3P acyltransferase.
AN   GPAT.
AN   LPA synthase.
AN   Lysophosphatidic acid synthase.
CA   Acyl-phosphate + sn-glycerol 3-phosphate = 1-acyl-sn-glycerol 3-phosphate
CA   + phosphate.
CC   -!- The enzyme, found in bacteria, catalyzes a step in the most widely
CC       distributed bacterial pathway for the initiation of phospholipid
CC       formation.
CC   -!- The enzyme is membrane-bound.
