DE   1-acylglycerophosphoserine O-acyltransferase.
AN   Lysophosphatidylserine acyltransferase.
CA   Acyl-CoA + 1-acyl-sn-glycero-3-phosphatidylserine = CoA + 1,2-diacyl-
CA   sn-glycero-3-phosphatidylserine.
CC   -!- Acyltransferase which mediates the conversion of
CC       lysophosphatidylserine into phosphatidylserine.
CC   -!- The enzyme also catalyzes the acylation of
CC       lysophosphatidylethanolamine into phosphatidylethanolamine (cf.
CC       EC 2.3.1.n7).
CC   -!- Prefers oleoyl-CoA as the acyl donor.
