ID   2.3.2.12
DE   Peptidyltransferase.
CA   Peptidyl-tRNA(1) + aminoacyl-tRNA(2) = tRNA(1) + peptidyl(aminoacyl-
CA   tRNA(2)).
CC   -!- The enzyme is a ribozyme.
CC   -!- Two non-equivlant ribonucleoprotein subunits operate in non-concerted
CC       fashion in peptide elongation.
CC   -!- The small subunit forms the mRNA-binding machinery and decoding
CC       center, the large subunit performs the main ribosomal catalytic
CC       function in the peptidyl-transferase center.
