DE   Malate synthase.
AN   Glyoxylate transacetase.
AN   Glyoxylate transacetylase.
AN   Glyoxylic transacetase.
AN   L-malate glyoxylate-lyase (CoA-acetylating).
AN   Malate condensing enzyme.
