CC   -!- In association with EC 2.4.2.39, brings about the synthesis of
CC       xyloglucan.
CC   -!- Concurrent transfers of glucose and xylose are essential for this
CC       synthesis.
CC   -!- Not identical with EC 2.4.1.12.
