ID   2.4.1.170
DE   Isoflavone 7-O-glucosyltransferase.
CA   UDP-glucose + an isoflavone = UDP + an isoflavone 7-O-beta-D-glucoside.
CC   -!- The 4'-methoxy isoflavones biochanin A and formononetin and, more
CC       slowly, the 4'-hydroxy isoflavones genistein and daidzein, can act as
CC       acceptors.
