ID   2.4.1.214
DE   Glycoprotein 3-alpha-L-fucosyltransferase.
AN   GDP-fucose:beta-N-acetylglucosamine (Fuc to (Fuc-alpha-1->6-GlcNAc)-Asn-
AN   peptide) alpha-1->3-fucosyltransferase.
AN   GDP-L-Fuc:Asn-linked GlcNAc alpha-1,3-fucosyltransferase.
