DE   Cis-zeatin O-beta-D-glucosyltransferase.
CA   UDP-glucose + cis-zeatin = UDP + O-beta-D-glucosyl-cis-zeatin.
CC   -!- The enzyme from maize can use cis-zeatin and UDPglucose as
