ID   2.4.1.216
DE   Trehalose 6-phosphate phosphorylase.
AN   Trehalose 6-phosphate:phosphate beta-D-glucosyltransferase.
CA   Alpha,alpha-trehalose 6-phosphate + phosphate = glucose 6-phosphate +
CA   beta-D-glucose 1-phosphate.
