ID   2.4.1.246
DE   Mannosylfructose-phosphate synthase.
AN   Mannosylfructose-6-phosphate synthase.
AN   MFPS.
CA   GDP-mannose + D-fructose 6-phosphate = GDP + beta-D-fructofuranosyl-
CA   alpha-D-mannopyranoside 6(F)-phosphate.
CF   Mn(2+) or Mg(2+).
