CC       cycloisomalto-oligosaccharides of three sizes (7, 8 and 9 glucose
CC       units).
CC   -!- It will also catalyze the disproportionation of two isomalto-
CC       oligosaccharides molecules to yield a series of isomalto-
CC       oligosachharides and the addition of D-glucose to cycloisomalto-
