CC   -!- The enzyme, isolated from the bacterium Clostridium phytofermentans,
CC       catalyzes a reversible reaction.
CC   -!- Substrates for the phosphorolytic reaction are alpha-1,3-linked
CC       oligoglucans with a polymerisation degree of 3 or more.
CC   -!- Nigerose (i.e. 3-O-alpha-D-glucopyranosyl-D-glucopyranose) is not
