CC       galactolipids found in their photosynthetic membranes.
CC   -!- The enzyme belongs to the GT2 family of configuration-inverting
CC       glycosyltranferases.
CC   -!- Cf. EC 2.4.1.337.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 2.4.1.157.
