ID   2.4.99.5
DE   Galactosyldiacylglycerol alpha-2,3-sialyltransferase.
CA   CMP-N-acetyl-beta-neuraminate + 1,2-diacyl-3-beta-D-galactosyl-
CA   sn-glycerol = CMP + 1,2-diacyl-3-(3-(N-acetyl-alpha-D-neuraminyl)-beta-D-
CA   galactosyl)-sn-glycerol.
CC   -!- The beta-D-galactosyl residue of the oligosaccharide of glycoproteins
CC       may also act as acceptor.
//
ID   2.4.99.6
DE   N-acetyllactosaminide alpha-2,3-sialyltransferase.
AN   Neolactotetraosylceramide alpha-2,3-sialyltransferase.
CA   CMP-N-acetyl-beta-neuraminate + beta-D-galactosyl-(1->4)-N-acetyl-beta-D-
CA   glucosaminyl-R = CMP + N-acetyl-alpha-neuraminyl-(2->3)-beta-D-
CA   galactosyl-(1->4)-N-acetyl-beta-D-glucosaminyl-R.
CC   -!- The enzyme recognizes the sequence beta-D-galactosyl-(1->4)-N-acetyl-
CC       D-glucosaminyl (known as type 2 histo-blood group precursor
CC       disaccharide) in non-reducing termini of glycan moieties in
CC       glycoproteins and glycolipids.
CC   -!- The enzyme from chicken brain was shown to act on
CC       neolactotetraosylceramide, producing ganglioside LM1.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 2.4.99.10.
DR   Q48211, LST_HAEIN  ;  P72074, LST_NEIGO  ;  Q9JUV5, LST_NEIMA  ;
