ID   2.4.99.7
DE   Alpha-N-acetylneuraminyl-2,3-beta-galactosyl-1,3-N-acetylgalactosaminide
DE   6-alpha-sialyltransferase.
AN   Alpha-N-acetylneuraminyl-2,3-beta-galactosyl-1,3-N-acetyl-galactosaminide
AN   alpha-2,6-sialyltransferase.
AN   Cytidine monophosphoacetylneuraminate-(alpha-N-acetylneuraminyl-2,3-beta-
AN   galactosyl-1,3)-N-acetylgalactosaminide-alpha-2,6-sialyltransferase.
AN   NeuAc-alpha-2,3-Gal-beta-1,3-GalNAc-alpha-2,6-sialyltransferase.
AN   Sialyltransferase.
AN   Sialyltransferase 3C.
AN   Sialyltransferase 7D.
AN   ST6GALNAC.
CA   CMP-N-acetylneuraminate + N-acetyl-alpha-neuraminyl-(2->3)-beta-D-
CA   galactosyl-(1->3)-N-acetyl-D-galactosaminyl-R = CMP + N-acetyl-alpha-
CA   neuraminyl-(2->3)-beta-D-galactosyl-(1->3)-(N-acetyl-alpha-neuraminyl-
CA   (2->6))-N-acetyl-D-galactosaminyl-R.
CC   -!- Attaches N-acetylneuraminic acid in alpha-2,6-linkage to N-acetyl-
CC       galactosamine only when present in the structure of alpha-N-acetyl-
CC       neuraminyl-(2->3)-beta-galactosyl-(1->3)-N-acetylgalactosaminyl-R,
CC       where R may be protein or p-nitrophenol.
CC   -!- Not identical with EC 2.4.99.3.
