ID   2.5.1.18
DE   Glutathione transferase.
AN   Glutathione S-alkyltransferase.
AN   Glutathione S-aralkyltransferase.
AN   Glutathione S-aryltransferase.
AN   S-(hydroxyalkyl)glutathione lyase.
CA   RX + glutathione = HX + R-S-glutathione.
CC   -!- A group of enzymes of broad specificity.
CC   -!- R may be an aliphatic, aromatic or heterocyclic group; X may be a
CC       sulfate, nitrile or halide group.
CC   -!- Also catalyzes the addition of aliphatic epoxides and arene oxides to
CC       glutathione, the reduction of polyol nitrate by glutathione to polyol
CC       and nitrile, certain isomerization reactions and disulfide
CC       interchange.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.8.6.1, EC 2.5.1.12, EC 2.5.1.13, EC 2.5.1.14 and
CC       EC 4.4.1.7.
