ID   2.5.1.74
DE   1,4-dihydroxy-2-naphthoate polyprenyltransferase.
CA   An all-trans-polyprenyl diphosphate + 1,4-dihydroxy-2-naphthoate =
CA   a demethylmenaquinol + diphosphate + CO(2).
CC   -!- This enzyme catalyzes a step in the synthesis of menaquinone,
CC       in which the prenyl chain synthesized by polyprenyl diphosphate
CC       synthase is transferred to 1,4-dihydroxy-2-naphthoate (DHNA).
CC   -!- The bacterial enzyme is an inner membrane protein, with the
CC       C-terminus located in the periplasm.
CC   -!- It is highly specific for DHNA but not for a specific length of the
CC       prenyl chain.
