DE   Cysteine transaminase.
AN   Cysteine aminotransferase.
CA   L-cysteine + 2-oxoglutarate = mercaptopyruvate + L-glutamate.
CF   Pyridoxal 5'-phosphate.
DR   P33097, AATC_BOVIN ;  P00504, AATC_CHICK ;  P08906, AATC_HORSE ;
