AN   Histidinol-phosphate aminotransferase.
AN   Imidazole acetol-phosphate transaminase.
AN   Imidazolylacetolphosphate aminotransferase.
CA   L-histidinol phosphate + 2-oxoglutarate = 3-(imidazol-4-yl)-2-oxopropyl
CA   phosphate + L-glutamate.
CF   Pyridoxal 5'-phosphate.
