CC   -!- Works in combination with EC 1.1.3.44 to replace the 6'''-hydroxy
CC       group of 6'''-deamino-6'''-hydroxyneomycin C with an amino group.
CC   -!- The enzyme, characterized from the bacterium Streptomyces fradiae,
CC       can also catalyze EC 2.6.1.93.
DR   Q53U08, NEON_STRFR ;
