ID   2.6.1.96
DE   4-aminobutyrate--pyruvate transaminase.
AN   4-aminobutyrate aminotransferase.
AN   GABA transaminase.
AN   Gamma-aminobutyrate aminotransaminase.
AN   Gamma-aminobutyric acid pyruvate transaminase.
CA   (1) 4-aminobutanoate + pyruvate = succinate semialdehyde + L-alanine.
CA   (2) 4-aminobutanoate + glyoxylate = succinate semialdehyde + glycine.
CF   Pyridoxal 5'-phosphate.
