DE   Inositol-polyphosphate multikinase.
AN   Inositol polyphosphate 6-/3-/5-kinase.
AN   IP3/IP4 6-/3-kinase.
AN   IP3/IP4 dual-specificity 6-/3-kinase.
AN   IpK2.
CA   2 ATP + 1D-myo-inositol 1,4,5-trisphosphate = 2 ADP + 1D-myo-inositol
CA   1,3,4,5,6-pentakisphosphate.
CC   -!- This enzyme also phosphorylates Ins(1,4,5)P(3) to Ins(1,3,4,5)P(4),
CC       Ins(1,3,4,5)P(4) to Ins(1,3,4,5,6)P(5), and Ins(1,3,4,5,6)P(4) to
CC       Ins(PP)P(4), isomer unknown.
CC   -!- The enzyme from the plant Arabidopsis thaliana can also phosphorylate
CC       Ins(1,3,4,6)P(4) and Ins(1,2,3,4,6)P(5) at the D-5-position to
CC       produce 1,3,4,5,6-pentakisphosphate and inositol hexakisphosphate
CC       (InsP(6)), respectively.
CC   -!- Yeast produces InsP(6) from Ins(1,4,5)P(3) by the actions of this
CC       enzyme and EC 2.7.1.158.
