CC       of anhydro-N-acetylmuramic acid in proteobacteria.
CC   -!- The substrate is either imported from the medium or derived from the
CC       bacterium's own cell wall murein during cell wall recycling.
CC   -!- The product N-acetylmuramate 6-phosphate is produced as a 7:1 mixture
CC       of the alpha- and beta-anomers.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 2.7.1.n1.
