ID   2.7.2.4
DE   Aspartate kinase.
AN   Aspartokinase.
CA   ATP + L-aspartate = ADP + 4-phospho-L-aspartate.
CC   -!- The enzyme from Escherichia coli is a multifunctional protein, which
CC       also catalyzes the reaction of EC 1.1.1.3.
CC   -!- This is also the case for two of the four isoenzymes in Arabidopsis
CC       thaliana.
CC   -!- The equilibrium constant strongly favors the reaction from right to
CC       left, i.e. the non-physiological direction of reaction.
