ID   2.7.4.22
DE   UMP kinase.
AN   UMP-kinase.
AN   UMPK.
AN   Uridine monophosphate kinase.
AN   Uridylate kinase.
CA   ATP + UMP = ADP + UDP.
CC   -!- Strictly specific for UMP as substrate and is used by prokaryotes in
CC       the de novo synthesis of pyrimidines, in contrast to eukaryotes,
CC       which use the dual-specificity enzyme EC 2.7.4.14 for the same
CC       purpose.
CC   -!- Subject of feedback regulation, being inhibited by UTP and activated
CC       by GTP.
