ID   2.7.4.23
DE   Ribose 1,5-bisphosphate phosphokinase.
AN   Ribose 1,5-bisphosphokinase.
CA   ATP + alpha-D-ribose 1,5-bisphosphate = ADP + 5-phospho-alpha-D-ribose
CA   1-diphosphate.
CC   -!- This enzyme, found in NAD suppression mutants of Escherichia coli,
CC       synthesizes 5-phospho-alpha-D-ribose 1-diphosphate (PRPP) without the
CC       participation of EC 2.7.6.1.
CC   -!- Ribose, ribose 1-phosphate and ribose 5-phosphate are not substrates,
CC       and GTP cannot act as a phosphate donor.
