ID   2.7.4.24
DE   Diphosphoinositol-pentakisphosphate kinase.
AN   Diphosphoinositol pentakisphosphate kinase.
AN   PP-InsP(5) kinase.
AN   PP-IP(5) kinase.
CA   (1) ATP + 1D-myo-inositol 5-diphosphate 1,2,3,4,6-pentakisphosphate =
CA   ADP + 1D-myo-inositol 1,5-bis(diphosphate) 2,3,4,6-tetrakisphosphate.
CA   (2) ATP + 1D-myo-inositol hexakisphosphate = ADP + 1D-myo-inositol
CA   1-diphosphate 2,3,4,5,6-pentakisphosphate.
CC   -!- This enzyme is activated by osmotic shock.
CC   -!- Ins(1,3,4,5,6)P(5), 1D-myo-inositol diphosphate tetrakisphosphate and
CC       1D-myo-inositol bisdiphosphate triphosphate are not substrates.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 2.7.1.155.
