ID   2.7.7.61
DE   Citrate lyase holo-[acyl-carrier protein] synthase.
AN   2'-(5''-phosphoribosyl)-3'-dephospho-CoA transferase.
AN   Holo-ACP synthase.
AN   Holo-citrate lyase synthase.
CA   2'-(5-triphosphoribosyl)-3'-dephospho-CoA + citrate lyase apo-[acyl-
CA   carrier protein] = citrate lyase holo-[acyl-carrier protein] +
CA   diphosphate.
CC   -!- The gamma-subunit of EC 4.1.3.6 serves as an acyl-carrier protein
CC       (ACP) and contains the prosthetic group 2'-(5-triphosphoribosyl)-
CC       3'-dephospho-CoA.
CC   -!- Synthesis and attachment of the prosthetic group requires the
CC       concerted action of this enzyme and EC 2.4.2.52.
CC   -!- In the enzyme from Escherichia coli, the prosthetic group is attached
CC       to serine-14 of the ACP via a phosphodiester bond.
