ID   2.7.7.75
DE   Molybdopterin adenylyltransferase.
CA   ATP + molybdopterin = diphosphate + adenylyl-molybdopterin.
CF   Mn(2+) or Mg(2+).
CC   -!- Catalyzes the activation of molybdopterin for molybdenum insertion.
CC   -!- In eukaryotes, this reaction is catalyzed by the C-terminal domain of
CC       a fusion protein that also includes molybdopterin molybdotransferase
CC       (EC 2.10.1.1).
CC   -!- The reaction requires a divalent cation such as Mg(2+) or Mn(2+).
CC   -!- Catalyzes the activation of molybdopterin for molybdenum insertion.
CC   -!- In eukaryotes, this reaction is catalyzed by the C-terminal domain of
CC       a fusion protein that also includes EC 2.10.1.1.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 2.7.7.n5.
