ID   2.7.7.76
DE   Molybdenum cofactor cytidylyltransferase.
AN   Mo-MPT cytidyltransferase.
AN   MoCo cytidylyltransferase.
CA   CTP + molybdenum cofactor = diphosphate + cytidylyl molybdenum cofactor.
CF   Mn(2+) or Mg(2+).
CC   -!- Catalyzes the cytidylation of the molybdenum cofactor.
CC   -!- This modification occurs only in prokaryotes.
CC   -!- ATP or GTP cannot replace CTP.
DR   Q46810, MOCA_ECOLI ;
