ID   2.7.7.78
DE   GDP-D-glucose phosphorylase.
CA   GDP-alpha-D-glucose + phosphate = alpha-D-glucose 1-phosphate + GDP.
CC   -!- The enzyme may be involved in prevention of misincorporation of
CC       glucose in place of mannose residues into glycoconjugates i.e. to
CC       remove accidentally produced GDP-alpha-D-glucose.
CC   -!- Activities with GDP-L-galactose, GDP-D-mannose and UDP-D-glucose are
CC       all less than 3% that with GDP-D-glucose.
