//
ID   2.7.8.10
DE   Sphingosine cholinephosphotransferase.
CA   CDP-choline + sphingosine = CMP + sphingosyl-phosphocholine.
//
ID   2.7.8.11
DE   CDP-diacylglycerol--inositol 3-phosphatidyltransferase.
AN   CDP-diacylglycerol--inositol phosphatidyltransferase.
AN   Phosphatidylinositol synthase.
CA   CDP-diacylglycerol + myo-inositol = CMP + phosphatidyl-1D-myo-inositol.
