CA   ditrans,octacis-undecaprenol = n CMP + 4-O-(D-ribitylphospho)(n)-di((2R)-
CA   1-glycerophospho)-N-acetyl-beta-D-mannosaminyl-(1->4)-N-acetyl-alpha-D-
CA   glucosaminyl-diphospho-ditrans,octacis-undecaprenol.
