CA   (2) Diacylphosphatidylethanolamine + lipid A = diacylglycerol + lipid A
CA   4'-(2-aminoethyl diphosphate).
CA   (3) Diacylphosphatidylethanolamine + lipid A 1-(2-aminoethyl diphosphate)
CA   = diacylglycerol + lipid A 1,4'-bis(2-aminoethyl diphosphate).
