ID   2.7.99.1
DE   Triphosphate--protein phosphotransferase.
AN   Diphosphate--protein phosphotransferase.
AN   DiPPT.
AN   Pyrophosphate-protein phosphotransferase.
CA   Triphosphate + [microsomal-membrane protein] = diphosphate + [microsomal-
CA   membrane protein] phosphate.
CC   -!- This enzyme was originally thought to use diphosphate as substrate
CC       but this has since been disproved.
CC   -!- The activity is observed as the second part of a biphasic reaction
CC       after depletion of ATP.
CC   -!- Tripolyphosphate is a contaminant of (gamma-(32)P)ATP.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 2.7.1.104.
//
