ID   2.8.2.23
DE   [Heparan sulfate]-glucosamine 3-sulfotransferase 1.
AN   3'-phosphoadenylyl-sulfate:heparin-glucosamine 3-O-sulfotransferase.
AN   3-OST-1.
AN   Glucosaminyl 3-O-sulfotransferase.
AN   Heparan sulfate D-glucosaminyl 3-O-sulfotransferase.
AN   Heparin-glucosamine 3-O-sulfotransferase.
CA   3'-phosphoadenylyl sulfate + [heparan sulfate]-glucosamine = adenosine
CA   3',5'-bisphosphate + [heparan sulfate]-glucosamine 3-sulfate.
CC   -!- This enzyme differs from EC 2.8.2.29 and EC 2.8.2.30 by being the
CC       most selective for a precursor of the antithrombin-binding site.
CC   -!- It has a minimal acceptor sequence of: -> GlcNAc6S->GlcA->
CC       GlcN2S*+-6S->IdoA2S->GlcN2S->.
CC   -!- It can also modify other precursor sequences within heparan sulfate
CC       but this action does not create functional antithrombin-binding
CC       sites.
CC   -!- These precursors are variants of the consensus sequence: ->
