CC   -!- Maximum activity is shown with propanoyl-CoA.
//
ID   3.1.2.19
DE   ADP-dependent medium-chain-acyl-CoA hydrolase.
CA   Acyl-CoA + H(2)O = CoA + a carboxylate.
CC   -!- Requires ADP; inhibited by NADH.
CC   -!- Maximum activity is shown with nonanoyl-CoA.
//
ID   3.1.2.20
DE   Acyl-CoA hydrolase.
CA   Acyl-CoA + H(2)O = CoA + a carboxylate.
CC   -!- Broad specificity for medium- to long-chain acyl-CoA.
CC   -!- Insensitive to NAD(+) (cf. EC 3.1.2.19).
