ID   3.1.2.31
DE   Dihydromonacolin L-[lovastatin nonaketide synthase] thioesterase.
CA   Dihydromonacolin L-[lovastatin nonaketide synthase] + H(2)O = holo-
CA   [lovastatin nonaketide synthase] + dihydromonacolin L acid.
CC   -!- Dihydromonacolin L acid is synthesized while bound to an acyl-carrier
CC       protein domain of EC 2.3.1.161.
CC   -!- Since that enzyme lacks a thioesterase domain, release of the
CC       dihydromonacolin L acid moiety from the polyketide synthase requires
CC       this dedicated enzyme.
DR   Q0C8M2, LOVG_ASPTN ;  Q3S2U0, MOKD_MONPI ;
