ID   3.1.3.80
DE   2,3-bisphosphoglycerate 3-phosphatase.
AN   2,3-BPG 3-phosphatase.
CA   2,3-bisphospho-D-glycerate + H(2)O = 2-phospho-D-glycerate + phosphate.
CC   -!- This reaction is a shortcut in the Rapoport-Luebering shunt.
CC   -!- It bypasses the reactions of EC 5.4.2.11/EC 5.4.2.12 and directly
CC       forms 2-phospho-Dglycerate by removing the 3-phospho-group of 2,3-
CC       diphospho-Dglycerate.
CC   -!- The MIPP1 protein also catalyzes the reaction of EC 3.1.3.62.
PR   PROSITE; PDOC00538;
