CA   carrier-protein].
CC   -!- The enzyme cleaves acyl-[acyl-carrier-protein] species with acyl
CC       chains of 6-16 carbon atoms although it appears to demonstrate a
CC       preference for the unacylated acyl-carrier-protein (ACP) and short-
CC       chain ACPs over the medium- and long-chain species.
CC   -!- Deletion of the gene encoding this enzyme abolishes ACP prosthetic-
CC       group turnover in vivo.
CC   -!- Activation of apo-ACP to form the holoenzyme is carried out by
CC       EC 2.7.8.7.
