DE   Monoterpenyl-diphosphatase.
AN   Bornyl diphosphate hydrolase.
AN   Bornyl pyrophosphate hydrolase.
AN   Monoterpenyl-pyrophosphatase.
CA   A monoterpenyl diphosphate + H(2)O = a monoterpenol + diphosphate.
