CC       (+)-bornyl diphosphate; another has highest activity on the
CC       diphosphates of primary alylic alcohols such as geraniol.
//
ID   3.1.7.4
DE   Transferred entry: 4.2.1.133 and 4.2.3.141.
//
ID   3.1.7.5
DE   Geranylgeranyl diphosphate diphosphatase.
AN   Geranylgeranyl diphosphate phosphatase.
CA   Geranylgeranyl diphosphate + H(2)O = geranylgeraniol + diphosphate.
CC   -!- Involved in the biosynthesis of plaunotol.
CC   -!- There are two isoenzymes with different ion requirements.
CC   -!- Neither require Mg(2+) but in addition PII is inhibited by Zn(2+),
CC       Mn(2+) and Co(2+).
CC   -!- It is not known which isoenzyme is involved in plaunotol
CC       biosynthesis.
//
ID   3.1.7.6
