//
ID   3.1.7.7
DE   Transferred entry: 4.2.3.194.
//
ID   3.1.7.8
DE   Tuberculosinol synthase.
CA   Tuberculosinyl diphosphate + H(2)O = tuberculosinol + diphosphate.
CC   -!- Only found in species of Mycobacterium that cause tuberculosis.
