CC       cf. EC 3.1.7.9.
DR   P9WJ60, TUBOL_MYCTO;  P9WJ61, TUBOL_MYCTU;
//
ID   3.1.7.9
DE   Isotuberculosinol synthase.
CA   Tuberculosinyl diphosphate + H(2)O = (13S)-isotuberculosinol +
CA   diphosphate.
CC   -!- Only found in species of Mycobacterium that cause tuberculosis.
CC   -!- In addition, it also gives tuberculosinol in 1:1 mixture,
CC       cf EC 3.1.7.8.
CC   -!- The isotuberculosinol form was a 3:1 mixture of the 13S and 13R
