AN   Geraniol synthase.
AN   Geranyl pyrophosphate pyrophosphatase.
CA   Geranyl diphosphate + H(2)O = geraniol + diphosphate.
CF   Mn(2+) or Mg(2+).
CC   -!- Isolated from Ocimum basilicum (basil) and Cinnamomum tenuipile
CC       (camphor tree).
CC   -!- Geraniol is labelled when formed in the presence of ((18)O)H2O.
