ID   3.1.22.4
DE   Crossover junction endodeoxyribonuclease.
AN   Crossover junction endoribonuclease.
AN   Cruciform-cutting endonuclease.
AN   Endo X3.
AN   Endonuclease RuvC.
AN   Endonuclease VII.
AN   Endonuclease X3.
AN   Hje endonuclease.
AN   Holliday junction endonuclease CCE1.
AN   Holliday junction nuclease.
AN   Holliday junction resolvase.
AN   Holliday junction-cleaving endonuclease.
AN   Holliday junction-resolving endoribonuclease.
AN   Resolving enzyme CCE1.
AN   RusA endonuclease.
AN   RusA Holliday junction resolvase.
AN   RuvC endonuclease.
AN   SpCCe1 Holliday junction resolvase.
CA   Endonucleolytic cleavage at a junction such as a reciprocal single-
CA   stranded crossover between two homologous DNA duplexes (Holliday
CA   junction).
CC   -!- The enzyme from Saccharomyces cerevisiae has no endonuclease or
CC       exonuclease activity on single-stranded or double-stranded DNA
CC       molecules that do not contain Holliday junctions.
