ID   3.2.1.114
DE   Mannosyl-oligosaccharide 1,3-1,6-alpha-mannosidase.
AN   ManII.
AN   Mannosidase II.
CA   Man(5)GlcNAc(3)-[protein] + 2 H(2)O = Man(3)GlcNAc(3)-[protein] +
CA   2 alpha-D-mannopyranose.
CC   -!- The enzyme, found in plants and animals, participates in the
CC       processing of N-glycans in the Golgi apparatus.
CC   -!- It removes two mannosyl residues, one linked by alpha-1,3 linkage,
CC       and the other linked by alpha-1,6 linkage, both of which are removed
CC       by the same catalytic site.
CC   -!- The enzyme is sensitive to swainsonine.
DR   Q9LFR0, GMAN2_ARATH;  Q16706, MA2A1_HUMAN;  P27046, MA2A1_MOUSE;
DR   P28494, MA2A1_RAT  ;  P49641, MA2A2_HUMAN;  Q8BRK9, MA2A2_MOUSE;
DR   Q24451, MAN2_DROME ;
