ID   3.2.1.115
DE   Branched-dextran exo-1,2-alpha-glucosidase.
AN   Dextran alpha-1,2 debranching enzyme.
CA   Hydrolysis of (1->2)-alpha-D-glucosidic linkages at the branch points of
CA   dextrans and related polysaccharides, producing free D-glucose.
CC   -!- Does not hydrolyze disaccharides or oligosaccharides containing
CC       linear 1,2-alpha-glucosidic linkages.
//
ID   3.2.1.116
DE   Glucan 1,4-alpha-maltotriohydrolase.
AN   Exo-maltotriohydrolase.
