CA   polysaccharides, to remove successive maltotriose residues from the non-
CA   reducing chain ends.
CC   -!- Cf. EC 3.2.1.2, EC 3.2.1.60 and EC 3.2.1.98.
CC   -!- The products of all these enzymes have the alpha-configuration.
//
ID   3.2.1.117
DE   Amygdalin beta-glucosidase.
CA   (R)-amygdalin + H(2)O = (R)-prunasin + D-glucose.
