DR   P29262, AH4_PRUSE  ;
//
ID   3.2.1.118
DE   Prunasin beta-glucosidase.
CA   (R)-prunasin + H(2)O = D-glucose + mandelonitrile.
CC   -!- Highly specific; does not act on amygdalin, linamarin or gentiobiose
CC       (cf. EC 3.2.1.21).
