ID   3.2.1.122
DE   Maltose-6'-phosphate glucosidase.
AN   Phospho-alpha-glucosidase.
CA   Alpha-maltose 6'-phosphate + H(2)O = D-glucose + D-glucose 6-phosphate.
CC   -!- Hydrolyzes a variety of 6-phospho-alpha-D-glucosides, including
CC       alpha-maltose 6-phosphate, alpha,alpha-trehalose 6-phosphate, sucrose
