ID   3.2.1.149
DE   Beta-primeverosidase.
CA   A 6-O-(beta-D-xylopyranosyl)-beta-D-glucopyranoside + H(2)O = 6-O-(beta-
CA   D-xylopyranosyl)-beta-D-glucopyranose + an alcohol.
