CC       oolong and black tea.
CC   -!- In addition to beta-primeverosides (i.e. 6-O-(beta-D-xylopyranosyl)-
CC       beta-D-glucopyranosides), it also hydrolyzes 6-O-(beta-D-
CC       apiofuranosyl)-beta-D-glucopyranosides and, less rapidly, beta-
CC       vicianosides and 6-O-(alpha-L-arabinofuranosyl)-beta-D-
CC       glucopyranosides, but not beta-glucosides.
