CC   -!- The substrate group is a substituent on N-4 of an asparagine residue
CC       in the glycoprotein.
CC   -!- The mannose residue at the non-reducing end of the sequence may carry
CC       further alpha-D-mannosyl groups on O-3 or O-6, but such a substituent
CC       on O-3 of the beta-D-mannosyl group prevents the action of the
CC       enzyme.
CC   -!- The enzyme was obtained from the lily, Lilium longiflorum.
DR   Q75W54, EBM_ARATH  ;  Q5H7P5, EBM_LILLO  ;
