ID   3.2.1.153
DE   Fructan beta-(2,1)-fructosidase.
AN   1-FEH II.
AN   1-FEH w1.
AN   1-FEH w2.
AN   1-fructan exohydrolase.
AN   Beta-(2,1)-D-fructan fructohydrolase.
AN   Beta-(2-1)-D-fructan fructohydrolase.
AN   Beta-(2-1)-linkage-specific fructan-beta-fructosidase.
AN   Beta-(2-1)fructan exohydrolase.
