CC       fructofuranosyl-(2->6)-beta-D-fructofuranosyl-(2->6)-beta-D-
CC       fructofuranosyl alpha-D-glucopyranoside), some (but not all) inulin-
CC       type fructans can also be hydrolyzed, but more slowly (cf.
