CC       residues are also observed.
CC   -!- Since the enzyme is inactive on the non-sulfated agarose portion of
CC       the porphyran backbone, some agarose fragments are also included in
CC       the products.
CC   -!- Methylation of the D-galactose prevents its binding at position -1.
