AN   Mismatch-specific thymine-DNA N-glycosylase.
AN   TDG.
AN   Thymine DNA glycosylase.
AN   Uracil/thymine DNA glycosylase.
CA   Hydrolyzes mismatched double-stranded DNA and polynucleotides, releasing
CA   free thymine.
CC   -!- Thymine-DNA glycosylase is part of the DNA-repair machinery.
CC   -!- Thymine removal is fastest when it is from a G/T mismatch with a
CC       5'-flanking C/G pair.
CC   -!- The glycosylase removes uracil from G/U, C/U, and T/U base pairs
CC       faster than it removes thymine from G/T.
DR   Q13569, TDG_HUMAN  ;  P56581, TDG_MOUSE  ;
