DE   Aminodeoxyfutalosine nucleosidase.
AN   AFL nucleosidase.
AN   Aminofutalosine nucleosidase.
AN   Methylthioadenosine nucleosidase.
CA   6-amino-6-deoxyfutalosine + H(2)O = dehypoxanthine futalosine + adenine.
CC   -!- The enzyme, found in several bacterial species, catalyzes a step in a
CC       modified futalosine pathway for menaquinone biosynthesis.
CC   -!- While the enzyme from some organisms also has the activity of
CC       EC 3.2.2.9 the enzyme from Chlamydia trachomatis is specific for
CC       6-amino-6-deoxyfutalosine.
