ID   3.4.11.13
DE   Clostridial aminopeptidase.
AN   Clostridium histolyticum aminopeptidase.
CA   Release of any N-terminal amino acid, including proline and
CA   hydroxyproline, but no cleavage of Xaa-|-Pro.
CF   Cobalt cation or Mn(2+).
CC   -!- A secreted enzyme from Clostridium histolyticum.
