ID   3.4.11.14
DE   Cytosol alanyl aminopeptidase.
AN   Aminopolypeptidase.
AN   Arylamidase.
AN   Cytosol aminopeptidase III.
AN   Liver aminopeptidase.
AN   Puromycin-sensitive aminopeptidase.
AN   Soluble alanyl aminopeptidase.
CA   Release of an N-terminal amino acid, preferentially alanine, from a wide
CA   range of peptides, amides and arylamides.
CF   Cobalt cation or Zn(2+).
CC   -!- A puromycin-sensitive, cobalt-activated zinc-sialoglycoprotein that
CC       is generally cytosolic.
CC   -!- Multiple forms are widely distributed in mammalian tissues and body
CC       fluids.
