CC   -!- Formed from plasma prokallikrein (Fletcher factor) by factor XIIa.
CC   -!- Activates coagulation factors XII, VII and plasminogen.
CC   -!- Selective for Arg > Lys in P1, in small molecule substrates.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family S1.
