DR   P00777, PRTB_STRGR ;
//
ID   3.4.21.82
DE   Glutamyl endopeptidase II.
AN   GluSGP.
AN   Glutamic acid-specific protease.
CA   Preferential cleavage: -Glu-|-Xaa- >> -Asp-|-Xaa-. Preference for Pro or
CA   Leu at P2 and Phe at P3. Cleavage of -Glu-|-Asp- and -Glu-|-Pro- bonds is
CA   slow.
CC   -!- Inhibited by (18-Leu->Glu) modified turkey ovomucoid third domain.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family S1E.
PR   PROSITE; PDOC00124;
DR   Q07006, GLUP_STRGR ;
//
ID   3.4.21.83
DE   Oligopeptidase B.
AN   Protease II.
CA   Hydrolysis of -Arg-|-Xaa- and -Lys-|-Xaa- bonds in oligopeptides, even
CA   when P1' residue is proline.
CC   -!- Inhibited by Tos-Lys-CH(2)Cl.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family S9A.
PR   PROSITE; PDOC00587;
DR   P24555, PTRB_ECOLI ;  Q59536, PTRB_MORLA ;
//
ID   3.4.21.84
DE   Limulus clotting factor C.
CA   Selective cleavage of 103-Arg-|-Ser-104 and 124-Ile-|-Ile-125 bonds in
CA   Limulus clotting factor B to form activated factor B. Cleavage of -Pro-
CA   Arg-|-Xaa- bonds in synthetic substrates.
CC   -!- From the hemocyte granules of the horseshoe crabs Limulus and
CC       Tachypleus.
CC   -!- Factor C is activated by Gram-negative bacterial lipopolysaccharides
CC       and chymotrypsin.
CC   -!- Inhibited by antithrombin III.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family S1.
PR   PROSITE; PDOC00124;
DR   Q26422, LFC_CARRO  ;  P28175, LFC_TACTR  ;
//
ID   3.4.21.85
DE   Limulus clotting factor B.
CA   Selective cleavage of 98-Arg-|-Ile-99 bond in Limulus proclotting enzyme
CA   to form active clotting enzyme.
CC   -!- From the hemocyte granules of the horseshoe crabs Limulus and
CC       Tachypleus.
CC   -!- Factor B is activated by factor C.
DR   Q27081, CFB_TACTR  ;
//
ID   3.4.21.86
DE   Limulus clotting enzyme.
CA   Selective cleavage of 18-Arg-|- and 47-Arg-|- bonds in coagulogen to form
CA   coagulin and fragments.
CC   -!- From the hemocyte granules of the horseshoe crabs Limulus and
CC       Tachypleus.
CC   -!- Limulus clotting enzyme is activated by factor B.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family S1.
PR   PROSITE; PDOC00124;
DR   P21902, PCE_TACTR  ;
//
ID   3.4.21.87
DE   Transferred entry: 3.4.23.49.
