CC       alpha- and beta-HGF, but it does not activate plasminogen, which
CC       shares high homology with HGF.
CC   -!- Can also activate urokinase plasminogen activator (uPA), which
CC       initiates the matrix-degrading peptidase cascade.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family S1A.
