CC       through sequential cleavages.
CC   -!- The enzyme can also process the unfolded protein response stress
CC       factor ATF6 at an Arg-His-Lys-Lys-|- site, and the envelope
CC       glycoprotein of the highly infectious Lassa virus and Crimean Congo
CC       hemorrhagic fever virus at Arg-Arg-Lys-Lys-|-.
