CC   -!- This process involves the conversion of glycoprotein gp43 to gp41
CC       (ZPC) by the pars recta protease oviductin.
CC   -!- It is thought that the enzymatically active protease molecule
CC       comprises the N-terminal protease domain coupled to two C-terminal
