ID   3.4.22.39
DE   Adenain.
CA   Cleaves proteins of the adenovirus and its host cell at two consensus
CA   sites: -Yaa-Xaa-Gly-Gly-|-Xaa- and -Yaa-Xaa-Gly-Xaa-|-Gly- (in which Yaa
CA   is Met, Ile or Leu, and Xaa is any amino acid).
CC   -!- A cysteine endopeptidase from adenoviruses.
CC   -!- Activity is greatly stimulated by the binding to the enzyme of an
CC       11-residue peptide from the adenovirus capsid protein pre-VI at a
CC       site separate from the active site.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family C5.
