ID   3.4.23.2
DE   Pepsin B.
AN   Parapepsin I.
CA   Degradation of gelatin, little activity on hemoglobin. Specificity on B
CA   chain of insulin more restricted than that of pepsin A. Does not cleave
CA   1-Phe-|-Val-2, 4-Gln-|-His-5 or 23-Gly-|-Phe-24.
