ID   3.4.23.4
DE   Chymosin.
AN   Rennin.
CA   Broad specificity similar to that of pepsin A. Clots milk by cleavage of
CA   a single 104-Ser-Phe-|-Met-Ala-107 bond in kappa-chain of casein.
CC   -!- Neonatal gastric enzyme with high milk clotting and weak general
CC       proteolytic activity, formed from prochymosin.
CC   -!- Found among mammals with postnatal uptake of immunoglobins.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family A1.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 3.4.4.3.
