DE   Aspergillopepsin I.
AN   Aspergillopepsin A.
AN   Aspergillopepsin F.
AN   Aspergillopeptidase A.
AN   Awamorin.
AN   Proctase B.
AN   Protease type XIII.
AN   Proteinase B.
AN   Trypsinogen kinase.
