CC       A.awamori, A.foetidus, A.fumigatus, A.kawachii, A.niger, A.oryzae,
CC       A.saitoi, and A.sojae.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family A1.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 3.4.23.6.
