CA   A, preferring hydrophobic residues at P1 and P1', but also cleaving
CA   20-Gly-|-Glu-21 in the B chain of insulin. Clots milk, and activates
CA   trypsinogen.
CC   -!- From the imperfect fungus Penicillium janthinellum.
CC   -!- Closely related enzymes have been isolated from P.roqueforti and
CC       P.duponti.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family A1.
