DR   P11838, CARP_CRYPA ;
//
ID   3.4.23.23
DE   Mucorpepsin.
AN   Mucor rennin.
CA   Hydrolysis of proteins, favoring hydrophobic residues at P1 and P1'.
CA   Clots milk. Does not accept Lys at P1, and hence does not activate
CA   trypsinogen.
CC   -!- Isolated from the zygomycete fungi Mucor pusillus and M.miehei.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family A1.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 3.4.4.17 and EC 3.4.23.6.
