AN   Bacillus thermoproteolyticus neutral proteinase.
CA   Preferential cleavage: Xaa-|-Leu > Xaa-|-Phe.
CF   Ca(2+); Zn(2+).
CC   -!- A thermostable extracellular metalloendopeptidase containing four
CC       calcium ions.
CC   -!- Enzymes that may be species variants of thermolysin are reported from
CC       Micrococcus caseolyticus and Aspergillus oryzae.
CC   -!- Closely related but distinct enzymes are aeromonolysin, pseudolysin,
CC       bacillolysin, aureolysin and mycolysin.
CC   -!- Belongs to peptidase family M4.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 3.4.24.4.
