ID   3.5.1.127
DE   Jasmonoyl-L-amino acid hydrolase.
CA   A jasmonoyl-L-amino acid + H(2)O = jasmonate + an L-amino acid.
CC   -!- This entry includes a family of enzymes that recyle jasmonoyl-amino
CC       acid conjugates back to jasmonates.
CC   -!- The enzymes from Arabidopsis thaliana have been shown to also act on
CC       12-hydroxyjasmonoyl-L-isoleucine, generating tuberonic acid.
DR   O04373, ILL4_ARATH ;  Q8VYX0, ILL6_ARATH ;
