CC       an antibiotic substance produced by several Streptomyces species.
DR   D2Z025, DCSB_STRLA ;
//
ID   3.5.3.26
DE   (S)-ureidoglycine aminohydrolase.
CA   (S)-2-ureidoglycine + H(2)O = (S)-ureidoglycolate + NH(3).
CF   Mn(2+).
CC   -!- This enzyme, found in plants and bacteria, is part of the ureide
