ID   3.5.4.5
DE   Cytidine deaminase.
AN   (Deoxy)cytidine deaminase.
AN   Cytidine aminohydrolase.
AN   Cytosine nucleoside deaminase.
CA   (1) Cytidine + H(2)O = uridine + NH(3).
CA   (2) 2'-deoxycytidine + H(2)O = 2'-deoxyuridine + NH(3).
CF   Zn(2+).
CC   -!- Catalyzes the deamination of cytidine and 2'-deoxycytidine with
CC       similar efficiencies.
CC   -!- The enzyme, which is widely distributed among organisms, is involved
CC       in salvage of both exogenous and endogenous cytidine and
CC       2'-deoxycytidine for UMP synthesis.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 3.5.4.14.
