//
ID   3.5.4.16
DE   GTP cyclohydrolase I.
CA   GTP + H(2)O = formate + 2-amino-4-hydroxy-6-(erythro-1,2,3-
CA   trihydroxypropyl)-dihydropteridine triphosphate.
CC   -!- The reaction involves hydrolysis of two C-N bonds and isomerization
CC       of the pentose unit; the recyclization may be non-enzymic.
CC   -!- Involved in the de novo synthesis of tetrahydrobiopterin from GTP,
CC       with the other enzymes involved being EC 1.1.1.153 and EC 4.2.3.12.
