//
ID   3.6.4.10
DE   Non-chaperonin molecular chaperone ATPase.
AN   Molecular chaperone Hsc70 ATPase.
CA   ATP + H(2)O = ADP + phosphate.
CC   -!- This is a highly diverse group of enzymes that perform many functions
CC       that are similar to those of chaperonins.
CC   -!- They comprise a number of heat-shock-cognate proteins.
CC   -!- They are also active in clathrin uncoating and in the oligomerization
CC       of actin.
