AN   L-methionine carboxy-lyase.
AN   L-methionine decarboxylase.
CA   L-methionine = 3-methylthiopropanamine + CO(2).
//
ID   4.1.1.58
DE   Orsellinate decarboxylase.
AN   Orsellinate carboxy-lyase.
CA   2,4-dihydroxy-6-methylbenzoate = orcinol + CO(2).
//
ID   4.1.1.59
DE   Gallate decarboxylase.
AN   Gallate carboxy-lyase.
AN   Gallic acid decarboxylase.
CA   3,4,5-trihydroxybenzoate = pyrogallol + CO(2).
DR   F9US27, LPDC_LACPL ;
//
ID   4.1.1.60
DE   Stipitatonate decarboxylase.
CA   Stipitatonate = stipitatate + CO(2).
//
ID   4.1.1.61
DE   4-hydroxybenzoate decarboxylase.
AN   4-hydroxybenzoate carboxy-lyase.
AN   p-hydroxybenzoate decarboxylase.
CA   4-hydroxybenzoate = phenol + CO(2).
DR   Q9Z8L0, BSDC_CHLPN ;  P94405, YCLC_BACSU ;  Q7DBA7, YCLC_ECO57 ;
DR   Q9S4M7, YCLC_SEDHY ;
//
ID   4.1.1.62
DE   Gentisate decarboxylase.
AN   2,5-dihydroxybenzoate decarboxylase.
AN   Gentisate carboxy-lyase.
CA   2,5-dihydroxybenzoate = hydroquinone + CO(2).
//
ID   4.1.1.63
DE   Protocatechuate decarboxylase.
AN   3,4-dihydroxybenzoate decarboxylase.
AN   Protocatechuate carboxy-lyase.
CA   3,4-dihydroxybenzoate = catechol + CO(2).
DR   P86833, DBD34_SEDHY;  F9US27, LPDC_LACPL ;  Q9S4M7, YCLC_SEDHY ;
//
ID   4.1.1.64
DE   2,2-dialkylglycine decarboxylase (pyruvate).
AN   L-alanine-alpha-ketobutyrate aminotransferase.
CA   2,2-dialkylglycine + pyruvate = dialkyl ketone + CO(2) + L-alanine.
CF   Pyridoxal 5'-phosphate.
CC   -!- Acts on 2-amino-2-methylpropanoate (i.e. 2-methylalanine), 2-amino-2-
CC       methylbutanoate and 1-aminocyclopentanecarboxylate.
PR   PROSITE; PDOC00519;
DR   P16932, DGDA_BURCE ;
//
