CC       catalyzed by EC 3.5.99.10.
CC   -!- Also catalyzes 2,3-elimination and beta-replacement reactions of some
CC       indole-substituted tryptophan analogs of L-cysteine, L-serine and
CC       other 3-substituted amino acids.
