AN   ECH2.
CA   (3R)-3-hydroxyacyl-CoA = (2E)-2-enoyl-CoA + H(2)O.
CC   -!- This enzyme catalyzes a hydration step in peroxisomal beta-oxidation.
CC   -!- The human multifunctional enzyme type 2 (MFE-2) is a 79000 Da enzyme
CC       composed of three functional units: (3R)-hydroxyacyl-CoA
CC       dehydrogenase, 2-enoyl-CoA hydratase 2 and sterol carrier protein
CC       2-like units.
CC   -!- The enzymes from Aeromonas caviae and Arabidopsis thaliana are
CC       monofunctional enzymes.
