CC   -!- The enzyme has been characterized from several microorganisms,
CC       including Clostridium kluyveri, where it participates in succinate
CC       fermentation, Clostridium aminobutyricum, where it participates in
CC       4-aminobutyrate degradation, and Metallosphaera sedula, where it
CC       participates in the 3-hydroxypropionate/4-hydroxybutyrate cycle,
CC       an autotrophic CO(2) fixation pathway found in some thermoacidophilic
CC       archaea.
