ID   4.2.2.19
DE   Chondroitin B lyase.
AN   ChonB.
AN   Chondroitinase B.
CA   Eliminative cleavage of dermatan sulfate containing (1->4)-beta-D-
CA   hexosaminyl and (1->3)-beta-D-glucurosonyl or (1->3)-alpha-L-iduronosyl
