ID   4.2.2.23
DE   Rhamnogalacturonan endolyase.
AN   Alpha-L-rhamnopyranosyl-(1->4)-alpha-D-galactopyranosyluronide lyase.
AN   RG-lyase.
AN   Rgase B.
AN   Rhamnogalacturonase B.
CA   Endotype eliminative cleavage of L-alpha-rhamnopyranosyl-(1->4)-alpha-D-
CA   galactopyranosyluronic acid bonds of rhamnogalacturonan I domains in
CA   ramified hairy regions of pectin leaving L-rhamnopyranose at the reducing
CA   end and 4-deoxy-4,5-unsaturated D-galactopyranosyluronic acid at the non-
CA   reducing end.
CC   -!- The enzyme is part of the degradation system for rhamnogalacturonan I
CC       in Bacillus subtilis strain 168 and Aspergillus aculeatus.
