CC       discoideum.
CC   -!- It is specific for (2E,6E)-farnesyl diphosphate.
CC   -!- While the major product is the sequiterpene (2S,3R,6S,9S)-(-)-
CC       protoillud-7-ene, traces of pentalenene are also formed.
//
ID   4.2.3.161
