CC   -!- The sequiterpene (3S)-(+)-asterisca-2(9),6-diene has been shown to be
CC       synthezised in the slime-mold Dictyostelium discoideum.
CC   -!- The enzyme is specific for (2E,6E)-farnesyl diphosphate.
//
ID   4.2.3.162
DE   (-)-alpha-amorphene synthase.
CA   (2E,6E)-farnesyl diphosphate = (-)-alpha-amorphene + diphosphate.
