ID   4.2.99.21
DE   Isochorismate lyase.
AN   Isochorismate pyruvate lyase.
CA   Isochorismate = salicylate + pyruvate.
CC   -!- This enzyme is part of the pathway of salicylate formation from
CC       chorismate, and forms an integral part of pathways that produce
CC       salicylate-derived siderophores, such as pyochelin and
CC       yersiniabactin.
DR   Q7TYQ1, MBTI_MYCBO ;  Q73XV3, MBTI_MYCPA ;  P9WFX0, MBTI_MYCTO ;
