CC   -!- Member of the aromatic amino acid lyase family, other members of
CC       which are EC 4.3.1.3, EC 4.3.1.23 and EC 4.3.1.24.
CC   -!- The enzyme from some monocots, including maize, and from the yeast
CC       Rhodosporidium toruloides, deaminate L-phenylalanine and L-tyrosine
CC       with similar catalytic efficiency.
