CF   Pyridoxal 5'-phosphate.
CC   -!- Decomposes S-alkyl-L-cysteines by alpha,beta-elimination.
CC   -!- The enzyme cleaves a carbon-sulfur bond, releasing an alkyl thiol and
CC       an unstable enamine product that tautomerizes to an imine form, which
