DE   Alkylmercury lyase.
AN   Organomercurial lyase.
AN   Organomercury lyase.
CA   An alkylmercury + H(+) = an alkane + Hg(2+).
CC   -!- Acts on CH(3)Hg(+) and a number of other alkylmercury compounds,
CC       in the presence of cysteine or other thiols, liberating mercury as a
CC       mercaptide.
