//
ID   5.1.1.10
DE   Amino-acid racemase.
CA   An L-amino acid = a D-amino acid.
CF   Pyridoxal 5'-phosphate.
//
ID   5.1.1.11
DE   Phenylalanine racemase (ATP-hydrolyzing).
CA   ATP + L-phenylalanine + H(2)O = AMP + diphosphate + D-phenylalanine.
