CC       (UDP-2,3-diacetamido-2,3-dideoxy-alpha-D-mannuronic acid),
CC       an important precursor of the B-band lipopolysaccharide of
CC       Pseudomonas aeroginosa serotype O5 and of the band-A trisaccharide of
CC       Bordetella pertussis, both important respiratory pathogens.
CC   -!- Highly specific as UDP-alpha-D-GlcNAc, UDP-alpha-D-GlcNAcA (UDP-2-
CC       acetamido-2-deoxy-alpha-D-glucuronic acid) and UDP-alpha-D-GlcNAc3NAc
CC       (UDP-2,3-diacetamido-2,3-dideoxy-alpha-D-glucose) cannot act as
CC       substrates.
