ID   5.2.1.8
DE   Peptidylprolyl isomerase.
AN   Cyclophilin.
AN   Peptidyl-prolyl cis-trans isomerase.
AN   Peptidylprolyl cis-trans isomerase.
AN   PPIase.
AN   Rotamase.
