CC   -!- Also converts 2-deoxy-alpha-D-ribose 1-phosphate into 2-deoxy-D-
CC       ribose 5-phosphate.
CC   -!- Alpha-D-ribose 1,5-bisphosphate, 2-deoxy-alpha-D-ribose 1,5-
CC       bisphosphate, or alpha-D-glucose 1,6-bisphosphate can act as
CC       cofactor.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 2.7.5.6.
