ID   5.4.3.2
DE   Lysine 2,3-aminomutase.
CA   L-lysine = (3S)-3,6-diaminohexanoate.
CF   Iron-sulfur.
CC   -!- This enzyme is a member of the 'AdoMet radical' (radical SAM) family.
CC   -!- It contains pyridoxal phosphate and a [4Fe-4S] cluster and binds an
CC       exchangeable S-adenosyl-L-methionine molecule.
CC   -!- Activity in vitro requires a strong reductant such as dithionite and
CC       strictly anaerobic conditions.
CC   -!- A 5'-deoxyadenosyl radical is generated during the reaction cycle by
CC       reductive cleavage of S-adenosyl-L-methionine, mediated by the iron-
CC       sulfur cluster.
CC   -!- S-adenosyl-L-methionine is regenerated at the end of the reaction.
DR   Q8PYC9, ABLA_METMA ;  Q6LYX4, ABLA_METMP ;  E3PRJ8, KAMA_ACESD ;
DR   O34676, KAMA_BACSU ;  Q9XBQ8, KAMA_CLOSU ;  Q8RHX4, KAMA_FUSNN ;
//
ID   5.4.3.3
DE   Lysine 5,6-aminomutase.
AN   Adenosylcobalamin-dependent D-lysine 5,6-aminomutase.
AN   Beta-lysine 5,6-aminomutase.
AN   Beta-lysine mutase.
AN   D-lysine 5,6-aminomutase.
CA   (1) (3S)-3,6-diaminohexanoate = (3S,5S)-3,5-diaminohexanoate.
CA   (2) D-lysine = 2,5-diaminohexanoate.
CF   Cob(II)alamin; Pyridoxal 5'-phosphate.
CC   -!- This enzyme is a member of the 'AdoMet radical' (radical SAM) family.
CC   -!- A 5'-deoxyadenosyl radical is generated during the reaction cycle by
CC       reductive cleavage of adenosylcobalamin, which is regenerated at the
CC       end of the reaction.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 5.4.3.4.
DR   E3PRJ5, KAMD_ACESD ;  Q8RHX7, KAMD_FUSNN ;  E3PRJ4, KAME_ACESD ;
DR   Q8RHX8, KAME_FUSNN ;
