DE   Glutamate 2,3-aminomutase.
CA   L-glutamate = 3-aminopentanedioate.
CF   Iron-sulfur; Pyridoxal 5'-phosphate; S-adenosyl-L-methionine.
CC   -!- This enzyme is a member of the 'AdoMet radical' (radical SAM) family.
CC   -!- It contains pyridoxal phosphate and a [4Fe-4S] cluster, which is
CC       coordinated by 3 cysteines and binds an exchangeable S-adenosyl-L-
CC       methionine molecule.
CC   -!- During the reaction cycle, the AdoMet forms a 5'-deoxyadenosyl
CC       radical, which is regenerated at the end of the reaction.
DR   Q185C5, EAM_PEPD6  ;
