ID   6.1.1.10
DE   Methionine--tRNA ligase.
AN   Methionine translase.
AN   Methionyl-transfer ribonucleate synthetase.
AN   Methionyl-transfer ribonucleic acid synthetase.
AN   Methionyl-transfer RNA synthetase.
AN   Methionyl-tRNA synthetase.
AN   MetRS.
CA   ATP + L-methionine + tRNA(Met) = AMP + diphosphate + L-methionyl-
CA   tRNA(Met).
CC   -!- In those organisms producing N-formylmethionyl-tRNA(fMet) for
CC       translation initiation, this enzyme also recognizes the initiator
CC       tRNA(fMet) and catalyzes the formation of L-methionyl-tRNA(fMet),
CC       the substrate for EC 2.1.2.9.
