ID   6.1.1.11
DE   Serine--tRNA ligase.
AN   Serine translase.
AN   SerRS.
AN   Seryl-transfer ribonucleate synthetase.
AN   Seryl-transfer ribonucleic acid synthetase.
AN   Seryl-transfer RNA synthetase.
AN   Seryl-tRNA synthetase.
CA   (1) ATP + L-serine + tRNA(Ser) = AMP + diphosphate + L-seryl-tRNA(Ser).
CA   (2) ATP + L-serine + tRNA(Sec) = AMP + diphosphate + L-seryl-tRNA(Sec).
CC   -!- This enzyme also recognizes tRNA(Sec), the special tRNA for
CC       selenocysteine, and catalyzes the formation of L-seryl-tRNA(Sec),
CC       the substrate for EC 2.9.1.1.
