ID   6.3.2.10
DE   UDP-N-acetylmuramoyl-tripeptide--D-alanyl-D-alanine ligase.
AN   MurF synthetase.
AN   UDP-MurNAc-L-Ala-D-Glu-L-Lys:D-Ala-D-Ala ligase.
AN   UDP-MurNAc-pentapeptide synthetase.
AN   UDP-N-acetylmuramoyl-L-alanyl-D-glutamyl-L-lysyl-D-alanyl-D-alanine
AN   synthetase.
AN   UDP-N-acetylmuramoyl-L-alanyl-D-glutamyl-meso-2,6-diaminopimeloyl-D-
AN   alanyl-D-alanine synthetase.
AN   UDP-N-acetylmuramoylalanine-D-glutamyl-lysine--D-alanyl-D-alanine ligase.
AN   UDP-N-acetylmuramoylalanyl-D-glutamyl-2,6-diaminopimelate--D-alanyl-D-
AN   alanine ligase.
AN   UDP-N-acetylmuramoylalanyl-D-glutamyl-lysine-D-alanyl-D-alanine ligase.
AN   UDPacetylmuramoylpentapeptide synthetase.
AN   Uridine diphosphoacetylmuramoylpentapeptide synthetase.
CA   ATP + UDP-N-acetylmuramoyl-L-alanyl-gamma-D-glutamyl-L-lysine + D-alanyl-
CA   D-alanine = ADP + phosphate + UDP-N-acetylmuramoyl-L-alanyl-gamma-D-
CA   glutamyl-L-lysyl-D-alanyl-D-alanine.
CC   -!- Involved with EC 6.3.2.4, EC 6.3.2.7 or EC 6.3.2.13, EC 6.3.2.8 and
CC       EC 6.3.2.9 in the synthesis of a cell-wall peptide.
CC   -!- Also catalyzes the reaction when the C-terminal residue of the
CC       tripeptide is meso-2,4-diaminoheptanedioate (acylated at its
CC       L-center), linking the D-Ala--D-Ala to the carboxy group of the
CC       L-center.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 6.3.2.15.
DR   P96613, MURF_BACSU ;  Q44777, MURF_BORBU ;  P57315, MURF_BUCAI ;
DR   Q89AQ1, MURF_BUCBP ;  P11880, MURF_ECOLI ;  P45061, MURF_HAEIN ;
DR   P0A5L5, MURF_MYCBO ;  O69556, MURF_MYCLE ;  P9WJL0, MURF_MYCTO ;
