CF   Biotin.
CC   -!- The Saccharomyces cerevisiae enzyme (but not that from green algae)
CC       also catalyzes the reaction of EC 3.5.1.54, thus bringing about the
CC       hydrolysis of urea to CO(2) and NH(3).
CC   -!- The enzyme from the prokaryotic bacterium Oleomonas sagaranensis can
CC       also use acetamide and formamide as substrates.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 3.5.1.45.
