ID   6.3.4.18
DE   5-(carboxyamino)imidazole ribonucleotide synthase.
AN   N(5)-CAIR synthetase.
AN   N(5)-carboxyaminoimidazole ribonucleotide synthetase.
CA   ATP + 5-amino-1-(5-phospho-D-ribosyl)imidazole + HCO(3)(-) = ADP +
CA   phosphate + 5-carboxyamino-1-(5-phospho-D-ribosyl)imidazole.
CC   -!- In Escherichia coli, this enzyme, along with EC 5.4.99.18,
CC       is required to carry out the single reaction catalyzed by EC 4.1.1.21
CC       in vertebrates.
CC   -!- Carboxyphosphate is the putative acyl phosphate intermediate.
CC   -!- Involved in the late stages of purine biosynthesis.
