DE   Formate--phosphoribosylaminoimidazolecarboxamide ligase.
AN   5-formaminoimidazole-4-carboxamide ribonucleotide synthetase.
AN   5-formaminoimidazole-4-carboxamide-1-beta-D-ribofuranosyl
AN   5'-monophosphate synthetase.
CA   ATP + formate + 5-amino-1-(5-phospho-D-ribosyl)imidazole-4-carboxamide =
CA   ADP + phosphate + 5-formamido-1-(5-phospho-D-ribosyl)imidazole-4-
CA   carboxamide.
CC   -!- This archaeal enzyme, characterized from the methanogen
CC       Methanocaldococcus jannaschii, catalyzes a step in the synthesis of
CC       purine nucleotides.
CC   -!- It differs from the orthologous bacterial/eukaryotic enzymes, which
CC       utilize 10-formyltetrahydrofolate rather than formate and ATP.
CC   -!- Cf. EC 2.1.2.3.
