DE   Ferredoxin--NAD(+) oxidoreductase (Na(+)-transporting).
AN   Rnf complex.
CA   2 reduced ferredoxin [iron-sulfur] cluster + NAD(+) + H(+) + Na(+)(Side
CA   1) = 2 oxidized ferredoxin [iron-sulfur] cluster + NADH + Na(+)(Side 2).
CF   Flavin; Iron-sulfur.
CC   -!- This electron transport complex, isolated from the bacterium
CC       Acetobacterium woodii, couples the energy from reduction of NAD(+) by
CC       ferredoxin to pumping sodium ions out of the cell, generating a
CC       gradient across the cytoplasmic membrane.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 1.18.1.8.
