DE   Na(+)-transporting two-sector ATPase.
AN   ATP synthase, sodium ion specific.
AN   Na(+)-translocating ATPase.
AN   Sodium-transporting two-sector ATPase.
CA   ATP + H(2)O + Na(+)(In) = ADP + phosphate + Na(+)(Out).
CC   -!- A multisubunit ATPase transporter found in some halophilic or
