DE   ABC-type Cd(2+) transporter.
AN   ABC-type cadmium-transporter.
AN   Cadmium-transporting ATPase.
CA   ATP + H(2)O + Cd(2+)(Side 1) = ADP + phosphate + Cd(2+)(Side 2).
CC   -!- A Saccharomyces cerevisiae enzyme that exports some heavy metals,
