ID   7.3.2.2
DE   ABC-type phosphonate transporter.
AN   Phosphonate-transporting ATPase.
CA   ATP + H(2)O + phosphonate-[phosphonate-binding protein](Side 1) = ADP +
CA   phosphate + phosphonate(Side 2) + [phosphonate-binding protein](Side 1).
CC   -!- An ATP-binding cassette (ABC) type transporter, characterized by the
CC       presence of two similar ATP-binding domains/proteins and two integral
CC       membrane domains/proteins.
