ID   7.4.2.2
DE   ABC-type nonpolar-amino-acid transporter.
AN   Nonpolar-amino-acid-transporting ATPase.
CA   ATP + H(2)O + nonpolar amino acid-[nonpolar amino acid-binding
CA   protein](Side 1) = ADP + phosphate + nonpolar amino acid(Side 2) +
CA   [nonpolar amino acid-binding protein](Side 1).
CC   -!- An ATP-binding cassette (ABC) type transporter, characterized by the
CC       presence of two similar ATP-binding domains/proteins and two integral
CC       membrane domains/proteins.
CC   -!- The enzyme, found in bacteria, interacts with an extracytoplasmic
CC       substrate binding protein.
CC   -!- This entry comprises enzymes that import Leu, Ile and Val.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 3.6.3.22.
PR   PROSITE; PDOC00185;
