CC       membrane domains/proteins.
CC   -!- The enzyme, found in bacteria, interacts with an extracytoplasmic
CC       substrate binding protein and mediates the import of maltose and
CC       maltose oligosaccharides.
CC   -!- Formerly EC 3.6.3.19.
